  <para style="h">Yohannis</para>
  <para style="toc1">Injiila Yohannis</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohannis</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Injiila</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohannis</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Dubbiin Foon Taʼuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Jalqabatti dubbiitu ture; dubbichis Allaah wajjin ture; dubbiin sunis Allaah ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Innis jalqabatti Allaah wajjin ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Wanni hundinuu isaan taʼe; waan taʼe hunda keessaas wanni isa malee taʼe tokko iyyuu hin jiru. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Jireenyi isa keessa ture; jireenyi sunis ifa namootaa ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ifni sun dukkana keessatti ni ibsa; dukkanni garuu isa hin moʼanne.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nama Allaah biraa ergame kan maqaan isaa Yahyaa jedhamu tokkotu ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Innis akka namni hundinuu karaa isaatiin amanuuf dhuga baatuu taʼee waaʼee ifa sanaa dhugaa baʼuuf dhufe. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Waaʼee ifa sanaa dhugaa baʼuu dhufe malee inni mataan isaa ifa hin turre.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Ifni dhugaa kan nama hundaaf ifa kennu sun gara addunyaa dhufaa ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Inni addunyaa keessa ture; addunyaan isaan uumame; addunyaan garuu isa hin beekne. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Innis gara saba isaa dhufe; sabni isaa garuu isa hin fudhanne. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Warra isa fudhatanii maqaa isaatti amananiif garuu akka ijoollee Allaaha taʼaniif mirga kenne. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Isaanis Allaah irraa dhalatan malee dhiiga irraa yookaan fedhii foonii irraa yookaan fedhii dhiiraa irraa hin dhalanne.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Dubbiin foon taʼee nu gidduu jiraate. Nus ulfina isaa, ulfina Ilma Tokkicha ayyaanaa fi dhugaadhaan guutamee Abbaa biraa dhufe sanaa argineerra.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yahyaanis waaʼee isaa dhugaa baʼe. Sagalee isaas ol fudhatee akkana jedhe; “Inni ani, ‘Inni na duubaan dhufu na caala; inni na dura tureetii’ jedhee waaʼee isaa dubbadhe sun isa kana.” <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Guutama isaa irraas hundi keenya ayyaana irratti ayyaana arganneerra. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Seerri karaa Muusaatiin kennameetii; ayyaannii fi dhugaan garuu karaa Iisaa Al-Masiihiitiin dhufe. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Eenyu iyyuu takkumaa Allaah hin argine; garuu Ilma Tokkicha Abbaa bira jiru sanatu isa beeksise.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahyaan Akka Ofii Isaatii Al-Masiihii Hin taʼin Dubbate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Yommuu Yihuudoonni lubootaa fi Lewwota Yerusaalem Yahyaatti erganii, “Ati eenyu?” jedhanii gaafachiisanitti dhuga baʼumsi Yohannis kenne kana ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Inni dhugaa baʼe malee hin ganne; “Ani Al-Masiihi miti” jedhee dhugaa baʼe.<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Isaanis, “Yoos ati eenyu ree? Iliyaas moo?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Innis, “Lakki, ani isa miti” jedhee deebiseef.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Isaanis, “Yoos ati Nabiiʼiyyichaa ree?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">KeD 18:15</ref></char></char></note> jedhaniin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Inni immoo, “Lakki” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Isaanis, “Ati eenyu ree? Akka warra nu erganiif deebii kenninuuf ati eenyu ofiin jetta?” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yahyaanis dubbii Isaayyaas nabiiʼiyyichi dubbate sanaan deebisee, “Ani sagalee gammoojjii keessaa, ‘Gooftaaf karaa qajeelchaa’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref></char></char></note> jedhee iyyu sanaa dha” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Fariisonni ergaman tokko tokkos, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />akkana jedhanii isa gaafatan; “Ati erga Al-Masiihii yookaan Iliyaas yookaan nabiiʼiyyicha taʼuu baattee maaliif cuuphxa ree?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yahyaan immoo akkana jedhee deebiseef; “Ani bishaaniin nan cuupha; namni isin isa hin beekne tokko garuu isin gidduu dhaabata. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Innis isa na duubaan dhufu kan ani hidhaa kophee isaa iyyuu hiikuufii hin mallee dha.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Wanni kun hundi Yordaanos gama iddoo Yahyaan itti cuuphaa ture Biitaaniyaa keessatti taʼe.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaa Hoolaa Allaah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Guyyaa itti aanutti Yahyaan utuu Iisaan gara isaa dhufuu argee akkana jedhe; “Ilaa Hoolaa Allaaha isa cubbuu addunyaa balleessu! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Inni ani, ‘Namni na duubaan dhufu na caala; inni na dura tureetii’ jedhee waaʼee isaa dubbadhe sun isa kana. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Ani mataan koo iyyuu isa hin beekun ture; sababiin ani bishaaniin cuuphaa dhufeef garuu akka inni saba Israaʼelitti mulʼifamuuf.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yahyaan itti fufee akkana jedhee dhugaa baʼe; “Ani utuu Hafuurri akkuma gugeetti shamaayʼun irraa gad buʼee isa irra jiraatuu nan arge. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Inni akka ani bishaaniin cuuphuuf na erge sun, ‘Namichi ati utuu Hafuurri gad buʼee isa irra jiraatuu argitu sun, isa Hafuura Qulqulluudhaan cuuphu dha’ jedhee utuu natti himuu baatee silaa ani iyyuu isa hin beeku ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Anis argeera; akka inni Ilma Allaaha taʼes dhugaa baʼeera.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barattoonni Yahyaa Iisaa Duukaa Buʼuu Isaanii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 1:40-42">1:40‑42</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18‑22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1:16‑20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:2-11">Luq 5:2‑11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Guyyaa itti aanutti Yahyaan ammas barattoota isaa keessaa lama wajjin achi ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Innis utuu Iisaan achi irra darbuu argee, “Ilaa, Hoolaa Allaaha!” jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Barattoonni lamaanis waan kana dubbachuu isaa dhagaʼanii Iisaa duukaa buʼan. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Iisaanis of irra garagalee isa duukaa buʼuu isaanii argee, <char style="wj">“Isin maal barbaaddu?”</char> jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Isaanis, “Rabbii, ati eessa jiraatta?” jedhaniin. Rabbii jechuun Barsiisaa jechuu dha.<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Innis, <char style="wj">“Kottaatii ilaalaa”</char> jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:39">Isaanis dhaqanii akka inni eessa jiraatu argan; gaafa sana isa wajjin oolan. Yeroon sunis gara saʼaatii kurnaffaa ture.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Warra waan Yahyaan dubbate dhagaʼanii Iisaa duukaa buʼan lamaan keessaa inni tokko Indiriiyaas obboleessa Simoon Phexros ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Innis duraan dursee obboleessa isaa Simoonin argatee, “Nu Al-Masiihicha arganneerra” jedheen; Al-Masiihii jechuun Kiristoos jechuu dha. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Indiriiyaasis Simʼoonin gara Iisaatti fide.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Iisaanis isa ilaalee, <char style="wj">“Ati Simoon ilma Yohannis, Keefaa jedhamtee ni waamamta”</char> jedheen. Keefaa jechuun Phexros jechuu dha.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Fiiliphoosii fi Naatnaaʼelin Waamuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Iisaanis guyyaa itti aanutti Galiilaa dhaquu barbaade. Innis Fiiliphoosin argee, <char style="wj">“Na duukaa buʼi”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Fiiliphoosis akkuma Indiriiyaasii fi Phexros nama magaalaa Beetisayidaa ture. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Fiiliphoos Naatnaaʼelin argee, “Isa Muusaan kitaaba Seeraa keessatti waaʼee isaa barreessee fi isa nabiiʼiyyoonnis waaʼee isaa barreessan, ilma Yuusuf, Iisaa nama Naazreeti arganneerra” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Naatnaaʼelis, “Naazreeti keessaa wanni gaariin baʼuu ni dandaʼaa?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Fiiliphoosis, “Kottuutii ilaali” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Iisaanis utuu Naatnaaʼel gara isaa dhufuu argee, <char style="wj">“Ilaa Israaʼelicha dhugaa kan haxxummaan keessa hin jirre!”</char> jedhee waaʼee isaa dubbate.<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Naatnaaʼelis, “Ati eessatti na beekta?” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Utuu Fiiliphoos si hin waamin dura yeroo ati muka harbuu jala turtettin si arge”</char> jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Naatnaaʼelis, “Yaa Barsiisaa, ati Ilma Allaaha ti! Ati Mootii Israaʼel” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Ati sababii ani muka harbuu jalattan si arge siin jedheef amantee? Waan kana caalu iyyuu arguuf jirta.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Innis itti dabalee, <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isiniin jedha; shamaayʼuniin banamee utuu malaʼikkoonni Allaaha Ilma Namaa irra ol baʼanii gad buʼanuu ni argitu”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Bishaan Gara Daadhii Wayiniitti Geeddaruu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Guyyaa sadaffaatti Qaanaa Galiilaa keessa cidha gaaʼelaatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cidha gaaʼelaatu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">– Cidhi gaaʼelaa torban tokko guutuu fudhata ture.</char></note> ture. Haati Iisaas achi turte; <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Iisaa fi barattoonni isaa gara cidha sanaatti waamamanii turan. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Yommuu Daadhiin wayinii dhumetti haati Iisaa, “Jarri daadhii wayinii hin qaban” isaan jette.<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Iisaan immoo deebisee, <char style="wj">“Dubartii nana! Maal godhi naan jetta? Yeroon koo amma illee hin geenye”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Haati isaas tajaajiltootaan, “Waanuma inni isinitti himu hunda godhaa” jette.<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Gaaniiwwan dhagaa jaʼa sirna qulqulleessuu Yihuudootaatiif achi dhaabamanii turan; tokkoon tokkoon isaaniis gara liitiroo 75 hamma 115 qabata ture.<verse eid="JHN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Iisaan tajaajiltootaan, <char style="wj">“Gaaniiwwanitti bishaan guutaa”</char> jedhe; isaanis hamma afaan gaaniiwwaniitti guutan.<verse eid="JHN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Innis, <char style="wj">“Egaa budduuqsaatii abbaa cidhaatti kennaa”</char> jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 2:8">Isaanis akkasuma godhan; <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />abbaan cidhaas bishaan gara daadhii wayiniitti geeddarame sana afaaniin qabee ilaale. Daadhiin wayinii sun eessaa akka dhufe tajaajiltoota bishaan waraabanitu beeka malee abbaan cidhaa sun hin beeku ture. Innis misirricha waamee <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />akkana jedheen; “Namni hundi daadhii wayinii isa gaarii jalqabatti dhiʼeessee, erga keessumoonni machaaʼanii booddee immoo daadhii isa laafaa dhiʼeessa; ati garuu daadhii gaarii hamma ammaatti tursite.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Iisaan mallattoowwan isaa keessaa isa jalqabaa kana Qaanaa Galiilaa keessatti hojjete. Ulfina isaas ni mulʼise; barattoonni isaas isatti amanan.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Mana Qulqullummaa Qulqulleessuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 2:14-16">2:14‑16</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 21:12">Mat 21:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar 11:15‑17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Luq 19:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Kana booddees inni haadha isaa, obboloota isaatii fi barattoota isaa wajjin Qifirnaahomitti gad buʼe. Isaanis guyyoota muraasa achi turan.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Iisaanis waan Faasiikaan Yihuudootaa dhiʼaateef Yerusaalemitti ol baʼe. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Mana qulqullummaa keessattis warra loon, hoolotaa fi gugee gurguratanii fi warra taaʼanii maallaqa geeddaran arge. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Innis quncee irraa qaccee dhaʼatee nama hundumaa hoolotaa fi loon wajjin mana qulqullummaa keessaa ariʼe; saantima warra maallaqa geeddaraniis bittinneesse; minjaala isaaniis garagalche. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Warra gugee gurguraniinis, <char style="wj">“Kana hunda asii baasaa! Mana Abbaa koo mana daldalaa hin godhinaa!”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Barattoonni isaas, “Hinaaffaan mana keetii na gugguba”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Zab 69:9</ref></char></char></note> jedhamee akka barreeffame yaadatan.<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Yihuudoonnis deebisanii, “Kana hunda hojjechuuf akka taayitaa qabdu mirkaneessuuf mallattoo maalii nutti argisiisuu dandeessa?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Mana qulqullummaa kana jigsaa; ani immoo guyyaa sadiitti olin dhaabaa”</char> jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Yihuudoonnis deebisanii, “Mana qulqullummaa kana ijaaruun waggaa afurtamii jaʼa fudhate; ati immoo guyyaa sadii keessatti ol dhaabdaa?” jedhaniin. <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Manni qulqullummaa kan inni waaʼee isaa dubbate sun garuu dhagna isaa ti. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Erga inni duʼaa kaʼee booddee barattoonni isaa waan inni dubbatee ture sana yaadatan. Isaanis Katabbii Qulqulluu fi dubbii Iisaan dubbate amanan.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yeroo inni Ayyaana Faasiikaatiif jedhee Yerusaalem turetti namoonni baayʼeen mallattoo inni hojjete arganii maqaa isaatti amanan. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Iisaan garuu waan nama hunda beekuuf, amanee isaanitti of hin dhiifne. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Akka namni tokko iyyuu waaʼee namaa isaaf dhugaa baʼu isa hin barbaachifne; inni waan nama keessa jiru beeka tureetii.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Niqoodemoosin Barsiisuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Fariisicha Niqoodemoos jedhamu bulchaa Yihuudootaa tokkotu ture. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Innis halkaniin Iisaa bira dhaqee, “Yaa barsiisaa, akka ati barsiisaa Allaah biraa dhufte taate nu beekna; nama Allaahan isa wajjin jiru malee namni mallattoo ati hojjettu kana hojjechuu dandaʼu tokko iyyuu hin jiruutii” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Iisaanis deebisee, <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman sitti hima; namni yoo lammata dhalate malee mootummaa Allaaha arguu hin dandaʼu”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Niqoodemoos immoo, “Namni erga dulloomee booddee akkamitti dhalachuu dandaʼa? Dhalachuuf jedhee lammata gadameessa haadha isaa keessa seenuu dandaʼaa?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebise; <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman sitti hima; namni yoo bishaanii fi Hafuura irraa dhalate malee mootummaa Allaahatti galuu hin dandaʼu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" /><char style="wj">Kan foon irraa dhalate foon; kan Hafuura irraa dhalate garuu hafuura.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" /><char style="wj">Jecha ani, ‘Ati lammata dhalachuu si barbaachisa siin jedhe hin dinqifatin.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" /><char style="wj">Bubbeen gara fedhetti bubbisa. Atis huursuu isaa dhageessa malee akka inni eessaa dhufee fi akka inni garamitti deemu hin beektu; namni Hafuura irraa dhalate hundinuus akkanuma.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Niqoodemoosis, “Kun akkamitti taʼuu dandaʼa?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Iisaan akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Ati utuu barsiisaa Israaʼel taatee jirtuu waan kana hin beektuu?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman, dhuguman sitti hima; nu waan beeknu dubbanna; waan argines dhugaa ni baana; isin garuu dhugaa baʼumsa keenya hin fudhattan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" /><char style="wj">Isin yoo ani waan addunyaa isinitti himnaan hin amanin, yoo ani waan shamaayʼun isinitti hime akkamitti amantu ree?</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" /><char style="wj">Ilma Namaa isa shamaayʼun irraa gad buʼe malee eenyu iyyuu shamaayʼuniitti ol hin baane.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" /><char style="wj">Akkuma Muusaan gammoojjii keessatti bofa fannise</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Lak 21:9</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">sana Ilmi Namaas fannifamuu qaba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" /><char style="wj">Kunis akka namni isatti amanu hundi jireenya bara baraa qabaatuuf.”</char><verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kan isatti amanu hundi jireenya bara baraa akka qabaatuuf malee akka hin badneef, Allaahan hamma Ilma isaa tokkicha kennutti addunyaa jaallateeraatii. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Allaahan karaa isaatiin addunyaa fayyisuudhaaf malee addunyaatti muruuf Ilma isaa gara addunyaatti hin ergineetii. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Kan isatti amanutti hin muramu; kan isatti hin amanne garuu waan inni maqaa Ilma Allaaha tokkichaatti hin amaniniif ammuma iyyuu itti murameera. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Murtiin sunis isa kana: Ifni gara addunyaa dhufe; namoonni garuu waan hojiin isaanii hamaa tureef ifa caalaa dukkana jaallatan. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Namni waan hamaa hojjetu kam iyyuu ifa jibba; akka hojiin isaa ifatti hin baafamneefis gara ifaa hin dhufu. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Namni dhugaa hojjetu kam iyyuu garuu akka hojiin isaa akka fedhii Allaahatti hojjetamuun isaa mulʼatuuf gara ifaa dhufa.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahyaan Waaʼee Iisaa Dhugaa Baʼe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ergasiis Iisaa fi barattoonni isaa gara biyya Yihuudaa dhaqan; innis isaan wajjin achi ture; ni cuuphes. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yahyaanis naannoo Saalem iddoo Enoon jedhamutti ni cuupha ture; bishaan baayʼeen achi tureetii; namoonnis achi dhaqanii cuuphamu turan. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Kunis utuu Yahyaan mana hidhaatti hin galfamin taʼe. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Yommus barattoota Yahyaatii fi Yihuudii tokko gidduutti waaʼee qulqulleeffamuu irratti wal falmiin uumame. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Isaanis Yahyaa bira dhufanii, “Yaa barsiisaa, namichi si wajjin Yordaanos gama ture, kan ati waaʼee isaa dhugaa baate sun kunoo cuuphuutti jira; namni hundis gara isaa dhaquutti jira” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yahyaanis akkana jedhee deebise; “Namni yoo shamaayʼun irraa isaaf kenname malee homaa fudhachuu hin dandaʼu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Akka ani, ‘Ani Al-Masiihi miti; garuu isa dura nan ergame’ jedhe isin mataan keessan iyyuu dhugaa naa baatu. <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Misirrittiin kan misirrichaa ti. Miinjeen misirricha bira dhaabatuu fi isa dhaggeeffatu, yommuu sagalee misirrichaa dhagaʼutti akka malee gammada. Gammachuun sun kan koo ti; gammachuun koos amma guutuu taʼeera. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Inni guddaa taʼuu qaba; ani immoo xinnaa taʼuun qaba.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />“Kan olii dhufu inni hundumaa oli; inni lafaa immoo kanuma lafaa ti; waanuma lafaa dubbatas. Kan shamaayʼun irraa dhufu inni hundumaa oli. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Inni waan argee fi waan dhagaʼe dhugaa baʼa; dhuga baʼumsa isaa garuu eenyu iyyuu hin fudhatu. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Namni dhuga baʼumsa kana fudhates akka Allaahan dhugaa taʼe mirkaneesse. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Inni Allaahan erge dubbii Allaaha dubbata; Allaahanis safara malee Hafuura isaa ni kennaatii. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Abbaan Ilma ni jaallata; waan hundas harka isaatti kenneera. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Namni Ilmatti amanu jireenya bara baraa qaba; namni Ilmaaf hin ajajamne garuu dheekkamsa Allaahatu isa irra jiraata malee jireenya hin argu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaa fi Dubartii Samaariyaa Tokko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Egaa Iisaan Yahyaa caalaa barattoota akka baayʼifatee fi akka cuuphe Fariisonni dhagaʼuu isaanii Gooftaan ni beeke; <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />taʼus barattoota isaatu cuuphaa ture malee Iisaan ofii isaatii hin cuuphine. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Inni Yihuudaa dhiisee amma illee Galiilaatti deebiʼe.<verse eid="JHN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Innis Samaariyaa keessa darbuu qaba ture. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Kanaafuu gara magaalaa Samaariyaa kan Siikaar jedhamu tokkoo dhufe; magaalaan sunis lafa Yaaʼikuub ilma isaa Yuusufiif kenne sanatti dhiʼoo dha. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Boolli bishaanii kan Yaaʼikuub tokko achi ture; Iisaanis waan karaa deemuudhaan dadhabeef boolla bishaanii sana bira taaʼe. Yeroonis gara saʼaatii jaʼaa ture.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Dubartiin Samaariyaa tokkos bishaan waraabbachuu dhufte; Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Mee na obaasi”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Barattoonni isaa nyaata bituuf gara magaalaa dhaqanii turaniitii.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Dubartiin Samaariyaa sunis Iisaadhaan, “Ati utuu Yihuudii taatee jirtuu akkamitti ‘na obaasi’ jettee ana dubartii Samaariyaa kadhatta?” jetteen. Yihuudoonni warra Samaariyaa wajjin walitti dhufeenya hin qaban tureetii.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Iisaanis deebisee, <char style="wj">“Kennaa Allaahatii fi inni, ‘Na obaasi’ siin jedhu kun eenyu akka taʼe utuu beektee silaa situ isa kadhata ture; innis bishaan jireenyaa siif kenna ture”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Dubartittiinis akkana jetteen; “Yaa gooftaa, ati waan ittiin waraabbattu hin qabdu; boolli bishaanii kunis gad fagoo dha. Yoos bishaan jireenyaa eessaa argatta? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Ati abbaa keenya Yaaʼikuub isa boolla bishaanii kana nuu kenne caalta moo? Inni mataan isaa, ijoolleen isaatii fi horiin isaa boolla bishaanii kana keessaa dhugaa turan.”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedhee deebise; <char style="wj">“Namni bishaan kana dhugu hundinuu deebiʼee ni dheebota;</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" /><char style="wj">garuu namni bishaan ani isaaf kennu dhugu kam iyyuu gonkumaa hin dheebotu. Bishaan ani isaaf kennu isa keessatti burqaa bishaanii isa jireenya bara baraatiif burqu ni taʼa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Dubartittiinis, “Yaa Gooftaa, akka ani hin dheebonneef, bishaan waraabuufis akka ani as hin dhufneef bishaan sana naa kenni” jetteen.<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Iisaan immoo, <char style="wj">“Dhaqiitii dhirsa kee waamii kottu!”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Dubartittiin, “Ani dhirsa hin qabu” jetteen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Iisaanis akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Dhirsa hin qabu jechuun kee sirrii dha;</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" /><char style="wj">ati dhirsoota shan qabda turteetii; namichi amma si wajjin jirus dhirsa kee miti. Wanni ati amma dubbate dhugaa dha.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Dubartittiinis akkana jette; “Yaa Gooftaa, akka ati nabiiʼiyyii taate nan hubadha. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Abbootiin keenya tulluu kana irratti sagadaa turan; isin Yihuudoonni garuu iddoon namni itti waaqeffachuu qabu Yerusaalem jettu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Iisaanis akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Dubartii nana, na amani; yeroon isin itti tulluu kana irrattis taʼu yookaan Yerusaalemitti Abbaa hin waaqeffanne tokko ni dhufa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" /><char style="wj">Isin waan hin beekne waaqeffattu; nu sababii fayyinni Yihuudoota keessaa dhufuuf kan beeknu waaqeffanna.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" /><char style="wj">Warri dhugaan waaqeffatan yeroon isaan itti hafuuraa fi dhugaadhaan Abbaa waaqeffatan tokko ni dhufa; amma iyyuu dhufeera; Abbaan warra akkasitti isa waaqeffatan barbaada.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" /><char style="wj">Allaahan hafuura; warri isa waaqeffatanis Hafuuraa fi dhugaadhaan waaqeffachuu qabu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Dubartittiinis, “Ani akka Al-Masiihiin Kiristoos jedhamu dhufu nan beeka. Inni yommuu dhufutti waan hunda nutti hima” jetteen.<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Ani, namni amma sitti dubbachaa jiru kun isuma”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barattoonni Gara Iisaatti Deebiʼuu Isaanii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Barattoonni isaa yommusuma deebiʼanii utuu inni dubartii tokko wajjin dubbatuu arganii dinqisiifatan. Garuu namni, “Maal barbaadda?” yookaan “Maaliif ishee wajjin haasofta?” jedhee isa gaafatu tokko iyyuu hin turre.<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Dubartiin sunis okkotee ishee dhiiftee gara magaalaatti deebite; namootaanis akkana jette; <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Kottaatii nama waan ani hojjedhe hunda natti hime tokko ilaalaa! Tarii inni Al-Masiihii taʼinnaa?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Isaanis magaalaa keessaa baʼanii Iisaa bira dhufan.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Kana gidduutti barattoonni isaa, “Yaa barsiisaa, mee waa nyaadhu!” jedhanii isa kadhatan.<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Inni garuu, <char style="wj">“Ani nyaata isin hin beekne kanan nyaadhu qaba”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Barattoonni isaas, “Namatu nyaata fideefii laata?” jedhanii wal gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Nyaanni koo fedhii isa na ergee guutuu fi hojii isaa raawwachuu dha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" /><char style="wj">Isin, ‘Jiʼa afurtu hafe; ergasii midhaan walitti qabama’ jettu mitii? Kunoo, ani isinittan hima; akka midhaan bilchaatee walitti qabamuu gaʼe mee ol jedhaatii lafa qotiisaa ilaalaa!</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" /><char style="wj">Inni midhaan haamu amma iyyuu mindaa ni argata; jireenya bara baraatiif ija walitti ni qaba; kunis akka inni facaasuu fi inni walitti qabu waliin gammadaniif.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" /><char style="wj">Haala kanaan mammaaksi, ‘Inni tokko ni facaasa; kaan immoo ni haama’ jedhu sun dhugaa dha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" /><char style="wj">Ani akka isin waan itti hin dadhabin haammattaniifan isin erge. Warri kaan itti dadhabaniiru; isin garuu buʼaa dadhabbii isaanii galfattu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Namoonni Samaariyaa Baayʼeen amanuu Isaanii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Sababii dubartittiin, “Inni waan ani hojjedhe hunda natti hime” jettee dhugaa baateef namoonni Samaariyaa warri magaalaa sanaa baayʼeen isatti amanan. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Kanaafuu namoonni Samaariyaa yommuu gara isaa dhufanitti akka inni isaan wajjin turuuf isa kadhatan; innis guyyaa lama achi ture. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Sababii dubbii isaatiinis namoonni biraa baayʼeen isatti amanan.<verse eid="JHN 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Isaanis dubartittiidhaan, “Siʼachi wanni nu amannuuf sababii dubbii ati nutti himte sanaatiif miti; nu mataan keenya iyyuu isa dhageenyeerraatii; akka inni dhugumaan Fayyisaa addunyaa taʼes beekneerra” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Ilma Qondaala Tokkoo Fayyisuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Guyyaa lamaan sana booddee Iisaan Galiilaa dhaqe. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Iisaan mataan isaa iyyuu akka nabiiʼiyyiin tokko biyya isaa keessatti kabaja hin qabne dubbatee tureetii. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Yommuu inni Galiilaa gaʼettis warri Galiilaa isa simatan. Isaanis sababii Yerusaalem turaniif waan inni yeroo Ayyaana Faasiikaatti achitti hojjete hunda arganii turan.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Kanaafuu inni deebiʼee gara Qaanaa ishee Galiilaa keessaa iddoo itti bishaan gara daadhii wayiniitti geeddaree ture sanaa dhaqe. Qondaalli mootii kan ilmi isaa dhukkubsate tokkos Qifirnaahom keessa ture. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Namichi kunis yommuu akka Iisaan Yihuudaadhaa kaʼee Galiilaa dhufe dhagaʼetti isa bira dhaqee akka inni dhufee ilma isaa kan duʼuu gaʼe sana fayyisu isa kadhate.<verse eid="JHN 4:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Kana irratti Iisaan, <char style="wj">“Isin yoo mallattoo fi dinqii argitan malee hin amantan!”</char> isaan jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Qondaaltichis, “Yaa Gooftaa, maaloo utuu mucaan koo hin duʼin naa qaqqabi” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Ilmi kee ni jiraataatii gali!”</char> jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Namichis waan Iisaan isatti dubbate amanee deeme. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Utuu inni deemaa jiruus tajaajiltoonni isaa itti dhufanii akka ilmi isaa lubbuun jiru itti himan. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Innis yeroo itti mucaa isaatti wayyaaʼe gaafate; isaanis, “Kaleessa saʼaatii torbatti dhagna gubaan isa dhiise” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 4:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Abbaan mucichaas akka yeroon sun yeroo Iisaan itti, <char style="wj">“Ilmi kee ni jiraata”</char> jedheen taʼe hubate. Kanaafuu innis, warri mana isaa hundinuus ni amanan.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Kun mallattoo lammaffaa Iisaan erga Yihuudaadhaa Galiilaa dhufee hojjetee dha.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Beetisayidaatti Dhukkubsataa Fayyisuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Yeroo xinnoo booddee ayyaana Yihuudootaa tokkotu ture; Iisaanis Yerusaalemitti ol baʼe. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Yerusaalem keessa Karra Hoolaa bira haroo afaan Ibraayisxiitiin Beetizaataa jedhamu tokkotu jira; haroon sun gardaafoo shan qaba. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Gardaafoowwan sana keessas namoonni dhukkubsatan, jechuunis jaamonni, warri naafatanii fi warri dhagni irratti duʼe baayʼeen ciisanii raafama bishaanii eeggachaa turan. [<verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Malaʼikkaan Gooftaa yeroo yerootti gad buʼee bishaanicha ni raasa ture; raafama bishaanichaa booddee namni jalqabatti bishaan sana keessa seenu kam iyyuu dhukkuba qabu hunda irraa ni fayya ture.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Waraabbileen durii tokko tokko kutaa walakkaa luqqisaa sadii irraa jalqabee hamma luqqisaa afuriitti jiru hin qaban.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Namichi waggaa soddomii saddeeti dhukkubsate tokko achi ture. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Iisaanis yommuu isaa achi ciisu argee akka inni yeroo dheeraa haala kana keessa ture beeketti, <char style="wj">“Ati fayyuu barbaaddaa?”</char> jedhee isa gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Dhukkubsataan sunis, “Yaa Gooftaa, ani nama na gargaaree yommuu bishaanichi raafamutti haroo sana keessa na buusu hin qabu. Yeroo ani seenuu yaaluttis namni biraa na dursee seena” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Kana irratti Iisaan, <char style="wj">“Kaʼi! Siree kee fudhadhuutii deemi”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Namichis yeruma sana fayye; siree isaas fudhatee deeme.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Guyyaan wanni kun taʼe sunis Sanbata ture; <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Yihuudoonnis namicha fayye sanaan, “Harʼa Sanbata; seerri siree kee baachuu si dhowwa” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Inni garuu, “Namicha na fayyisetu <char style="wj">‘Siree kee fudhadhuu deemi’</char> naan jedhe” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Isaanis, “Namichi siree kee fudhadhuu deemi siin jedhe sun eenyu?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Namichi fayye sun sababii Iisaan achi hiiqee tuuta iddoo sana ture keessa seeneef inni eenyu akka taʼe hin beekne.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Iisaanis ergasii namicha sana mana qulqullummaa keessatti argee, <char style="wj">“Ati kunoo amma fayyiteerta. Wanni kana caalu akka sitti hin dhufneef siʼachi cubbuu hin hojjetin”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Namichis dhaqee kan isa fayyise Iisaa akka taʼe Yihuudootatti hime.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jireenya Ilmi Kennu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kanaafuu sababii inni Sanbataan waan kana hojjeteef, Yihuudoonni Iisaa ariʼachuu jalqaban. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Iisaan garuu, <char style="wj">“Abbaan koo hamma ammaatti hojjechaa jira; anis hojjechaan jira”</char> isaaniin jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Sababii kanaaf Yihuudoonni ittuma caalchisanii isa ajjeesuu barbaadan; inni Allaahan of qixxeessuudhaan Allaah iyyuu Abbaa ofii isaa godhee waamaa ture malee Sanbata qofa hin cabsine.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; Ilmi ofii isaatiin waan tokko illee hojjechuu hin dandaʼu; inni waanuma utuu Abbaan isaa hojjetuu arge qofa hojjechuu dandaʼa; waanuma Abbaan hojjetu Ilmis akkasuma hojjetaatii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" /><char style="wj">Abbaan Ilma ni jaallataatii; waan hojjetu hundumas isatti ni argisiisa. Akka isin dinqisiifattaniifis inni hojiiwwan hojiiwwan kanneen caalan iyyuu isatti ni argisiisa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" /><char style="wj">Akkuma Abbaan warra duʼan duʼaa kaasee jireenya kennuuf sana, Ilmis akkasuma abbaa fedheef jireenya ni kenna.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" /><char style="wj">Abbaan eenyutti illee hin muru; murtii hunda garuu Ilmatti kenneera;</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" /><char style="wj">kunis akka namni hundi akkuma Abbaaf ulfina kennutti Ilmaafis ulfina kennuuf. Namni Ilmaaf ulfina hin kennine, Abbaa isa Ilma ergeefis ulfina hin kennu.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; namni dubbii koo dhagaʼu, isa na ergettis kan amanu hundi jireenya bara baraa qaba; murtiittis hin dhiʼaatu; inni duʼa jalaa gara jireenyaatti darbeera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; yeroon warri duʼan itti sagalee Ilma Allaaha dhagaʼan tokko ni dhufa; ammuma iyyuu dhufeera; warri dhagaʼanis ni jiraatu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" /><char style="wj">Akkuma Abbaan ofuma isaatiin jireenya qabu sana, Ilmis akkasuma akka ofuma isaatiin jireenya qabaatuuf isaaf kenneeraatii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" /><char style="wj">Sababii inni Ilma Namaa taʼeefis Abbaan akka inni murtii kennuuf taayitaa isaaf kenneera.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />
    <char style="wj">“Kana hin dinqisiifatinaa; saʼaatiin itti warri qabrii keessa jiran hundi sagalee isaa dhagaʼan tokko ni dhufaatii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" /><char style="wj">Warri waan gaarii hojjetan duʼaa kaʼuu jireenyaatiif, warri waan hamaa hojjetan immoo duʼaa kaʼuu murtiitiif duʼaa ni kaʼu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" /><char style="wj">Ani ofii kootiin waan tokko illee gochuu hin dandaʼu; ani akkuman dhagaʼutti nan murteessa; ani fedhii isa na ergee malee fedhii mataa kootii waan hin barbaanneef murtiin koo qajeelaa dha.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhuga baʼumsa Waaʼee Iisaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani yoon waaʼee ofii kootii dhugaa baʼe, dhuga baʼumsi koo dhugaa miti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" /><char style="wj">Garuu kan waaʼee koo dhugaa baʼu biraa jira; anis akka dhuga baʼumsi inni waaʼee koo kennu sun dhugaa taʼe beeka.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />
    <char style="wj">“Isin Yahyaatti ergitaniirtu; innis dhugaa sanaaf, dhugaa baʼeera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuga baʼumsa namaa hin fudhadhu; garuu akka isin fayyitaniif wantoota kanneen nan dubbadha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" /><char style="wj">Yahyaan ibsaa bobaʼee ifa kennu ture; isinis yeroo xinnoo ifa isaatti gammaduu barbaaddan.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani garuu dhuga baʼumsa, dhuga baʼumsa Yahyaa sana caalu qaba. Hojiin akka ani raawwadhuuf Abbaan natti kenne, kan ani hojjedhu kun iyyuu akka Abbaan na erge mirkaneessaatii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" /><char style="wj">Abbaan inni na erges ofii isaatii waaʼee koo dhugaa baʼeera. Isin takkumaa sagalee isaa hin dhageenye; bifa isaas takkumaa hin argine.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" /><char style="wj">Isin sababii isa inni erge hin amaniniif dubbiin isaa isin keessa hin jiraatu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" /><char style="wj">Isin Katabbiiwwan Qulqulluudhaan jireenya bara baraa arganna jettanii waan yaaddaniif Katabbiiwwan Qulqulluu sana qorattu. Katabbiiwwan Qulqulluun kunneenis waaʼee koo dhugaa baʼu;</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" /><char style="wj">isin garuu jireenya argachuudhaaf gara koo dhufuu hin barbaaddan.</char><verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani nama irraa ulfina hin fudhadhu;</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" /><char style="wj">garuu akka isin jaalala Allaaha of keessaa hin qabne nan beeka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" /><char style="wj">Ani maqaa Abbaa kootiin dhufeera; isin na hin simattan; utuu namni biraa maqaa ofii isaatiin dhufee garuu isa ni simattu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" /><char style="wj">Isin yoo wal irraa ulfina argattanii ulfina Allaah tokkicha biraa dhufu garuu hin barbaanne akkamitti amanuu dandeessu ree?</char><verse eid="JHN 5:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />
    <char style="wj">“Waan ani Abbaa duratti isin himadhu hin seʼinaa. Kan isin himatu tokko jira; innis Muusaa isin abdattan sana.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" /><char style="wj">Utuu Muusaa amantanii silaa anas ni amantu ture; inni waaʼee koo barreesseetii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" /><char style="wj">Isin erga waan inni barreesse hin amannee, dubbii koo immoo akkamitti amantu ree?”</char><verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Nama Kuma Shan Sooruu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">6:1‑13</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13‑21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:32-44">Mar 6:32‑44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luq 9:10‑17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Wantoota kanneen booddee Iisaan Galaana Galiilaa isa Galaana Xibeeriyaas jedhamu gama ceʼe; <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />namoonni baayʼeenis sababii mallattoo inni warra dhukkubsatan fayyisuudhaan hojjete arganiif isa duukaa buʼan. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Iisaanis barattoota isaa wajjin gaaratti ol baʼee taaʼe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Yeroo sana Ayyaanni Yihuudootaa, Faasiikaan dhiʼaatee ture.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Iisaan yommuu ol ilaaletti tuuta guddaa gara isaa dhufaa jiru tokko arge; Fiiliphoosiinis, <char style="wj">“Namoota kanneeniif buddeena isaan nyaatan eessaa bitanna?”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Kanas Fiiliphoosin qoruudhaaf jedhee gaafate; inni mataan isaa waan gochuu qabu beeka tureetii.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Fiiliphoos immoo, “Akka tokkoon tokkoon isaanii waanuma xinnoo illee argataniif buddeena gaʼu bituuf diinaarii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diinaariin tokko mindaa hojjetaan tokko guyyaatti argatu ture.</char></note> dhibba lama fudhata” jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Barattoota isaa keessaa tokko Indiriiyaas, obboleessi Simoon Phexros akkana jedheen; <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Gurbaan buddeena garbuu shanii fi qurxummii lama qabu tokko kunoo ti; garuu nama akkana baayʼatu kanaaf kun maali?”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Namoota teessisaa”</char> jedhe. Iddoo sanas marga baayʼeetu ture; namoonnis ni tataaʼan; dhiira gara kuma shantu achi ture. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Iisaanis ergasii buddeena fuudhee, galata galchee warra tataaʼaniif hamma isaan barbaadan qoqqoode. Qurxummii sana illee akkasuma godhe.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Innis yommuu isaan hundi nyaatanii quufanitti barattoota isaatiin, <char style="wj">“Hurraaʼaa hambifame walitti qabaa. Wanni tokko iyyuu hin badin”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Kanaafuu isaan hurraaʼaa buddeena garbuu shananii kan namoonni nyaatanii hambisan walitti qabanii gundoo kudha lama guutan.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Namoonnis yommuu mallattoo Iisaan hojjete arganitti, “Kun dhugumaanuu Nabiiʼiyyii gara addunyaa dhufuuf jiru” jedhan. <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Iisaanis akka namoonni sun dhufanii humnaan qabanii mootii isa gochuu yaadan hubatee ammas kophaa isaa gara tulluu deeme.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Bishaan Irra Deemuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">6:16‑21</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22‑33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:47-51">Mar 6:47‑51</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Yommuu galgalaaʼetti barattoonni isaa gara galaanaatti gad buʼan; <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />achittis bidiruu yaabbatanii galaana irra gama Qifirnaahomitti qajeelan. Yeroon sun dukkana ture; Iisaan amma iyyuu gara isaanii hin dhufne ture. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Bubbeen jabaan isaa waan bubbisaa tureef bishaanichi ni raafame. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Isaanis erga gara kiiloo meetira shanii yookaan jaʼaa mooqanii booddee utuu Iisaan galaana irra deemaa, bidiruu sanattis dhiʼaachaa jiruu argan; ni sodaatanis. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Inni garuu, <char style="wj">“Anumaatii hin sodaatinaa”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Isaanis bidiruutti ol isa fudhachuu barbaadan; bidiruun sunis yommusuma lafa isaan dhaqaa turan sana gaʼe.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Guyyaa itti aanutti namoonni galaanicha gamatti hafanii turan akka bidiruun tokko qofti achi ture, akka Iisaan barattoota isaa wajjin bidiruu hin yaabbatinii fi akka isaan kophaa isaanii deeman hubatan. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Bidiruuwwan biraa Xibeeriyaasii kaʼanii iddoo itti Gooftaan galata galchee isaanis itti buddeena nyaatan sana bira gaʼan. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Namoonni sunis yommuu akka Iisaa fi barattoonni isaa achi hin jirre baranitti bidiruuwwan yaabbatanii Iisaa barbaaduuf Qifirnaahom dhaqan.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Buddeena Jireenyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Namoonni yommuu galaanicha gamatti isa arganitti, “Yaa Barsiisaa, ati yoom as dhufte?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebise; <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; isin waan mallattoo argitaniif utuu hin taʼin, waan buddeena nyaattanii quuftaniif na barbaaddu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" /><char style="wj">Nyaata jireenya bara baraatiif taʼu kan Ilmi Namaa isinii kennuuf dadhabaa malee nyaata baduuf hin dadhabinaa. Allaahan Abbaan chaappaa isaa kan mirkaneessu Ilma irratti rukuteeraatii.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Isaanis, “Nu akka hojii Allaaha hojjennuuf maal gochuu qabna?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Isa inni ergetti amanuun keessan kun hojii Allaaha ti”</char> jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Kanaafuu isaan akkana jedhanii isa gaafatan; “Akka nu isa arginee si amannuuf, mallattoo maalii argisiifta? Maal hojjettas? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />‘Akka isaan nyaataniif shamaayʼun irraa buddeena isaaniif kenne’ jedhamee akkuma barreeffame, abbootiin keenya gammoojjii keessatti mannaa nyaatan.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Bau 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:15">Nah 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Zab 78:24</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 78:25">25</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Iisaanis akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman isinitti hima; kan shamaayʼun irraa buddeena isinii kenne Muusaa miti; kan shamaayʼun irraa buddeena dhugaa isiniif kennu garuu Abbaa koo ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" /><char style="wj">Buddeenni Allaaha isa shamaayʼun irraa gad buʼee addunyaaf jireenya kennu sanaatii.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Isaanis, “Yaa Gooftaa, yeroo hunda buddeena kana nuu kenni” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Iisaanis akkana isaaniin jedhe; <char style="wj">“Buddeenni jireenyaa ana. Namni gara koo dhufu gonkumaa hin beelaʼu; kan anatti amanus gonkumaa hin dheebotu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" /><char style="wj">Akkuma ani isinitti hime isin na argitaniirtu; garuu amma iyyuu hin amantan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" /><char style="wj">Kan Abbaan naa kennu hundi gara koo ni dhufa; anis kan gara koo dhufu gonkumaa alatti hin ariʼu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" /><char style="wj">Ani fedhii isa na erge sanaa guutuuf malee, fedhii koo guutachuuf shamaayʼun irraa gad hin buuneetii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" /><char style="wj">Fedhiin isa na ergees akka ani warra inni natti kenne hunda guyyaa dhumaatti duʼaa kaasuuf malee akka ani isaan keessaa tokko illee balleessuuf miti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" /><char style="wj">Fedhiin Abbaa kootiis akka namni Ilma ilaalee isatti amanu hundi jireenya bara baraa qabaatuuf; anis guyyaa dhumaatti duʼaa isa nan kaasa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Kana irratti Yihuudoonni sababii inni, <char style="wj">“Ani buddeena shamaayʼun irraa gad buʼee dha”</char> jedheef isatti guungumuu jalqaban. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Isaanis, “Kun Iisaa ilma Yuusuf, isa nu abbaa fi haadha isaa beeknu sana mitii? Yoos inni akkamitti, <char style="wj">‘Ani shamaayʼun irraa gad buʼeera’</char> jedha ree?” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Walitti hin guunguminaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" /><char style="wj">Abbaan na erge sun isa harkisuu baannaan namni kam iyyuu gara koo dhufuu hin dandaʼu; anis guyyaa dhumaatti duʼaa isa nan kaasa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" /><char style="wj">Nabiiʼiyyoota keessatti, ‘Isaan hundi warra Allaah irraa baratan ni taʼu’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54:13</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">jedhamee barreeffameera. Namni Abbaa irraa dhagaʼee fi kan isa irraa barate hundi gara koo ni dhufa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" /><char style="wj">Isa Allaah biraa dhufe sana malee namni tokko iyyuu Abbaa hin argine; isa qofatu Abbaa arge.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman isinitti hima; kan amanu jireenya bara baraa qaba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" /><char style="wj">Buddeenni jireenyaa ana.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" /><char style="wj">Abbootiin keessan gammoojjii keessatti mannaa nyaatan; taʼus ni duʼan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" /><char style="wj">Buddeenni shamaayʼun irraa gad buʼe garuu isa kana; namni isa nyaatu gonkumaa hin duʼu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" /><char style="wj">Buddeenni jiraataan shamaayʼun irraa buʼe ana. Namni kam iyyuu yoo buddeena kana irraa nyaate bara baraan ni jiraata. Buddeenni ani jireenya addunyaatiif kennus foon koo ti.”</char><verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Yihuudoonnis, “Namichi kun akkamitti akka nu nyaannuuf foon isaa nuu kennuu dandaʼa?” jedhanii wal falman.<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman isinitti hima; isin foon Ilma Namaa nyaachuu baannaan, dhiiga isaas dhuguu baannaan ofii keessaniin jireenya hin qabdan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" /><char style="wj">Namni foon koo nyaatuu fi dhiiga koo dhugu jireenya bara baraa qaba. Anis guyyaa dhumaatti duʼaa isa nan kaasa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" /><char style="wj">Foon koo nyaata dhugaatii; dhiigni koos dhugaatii dhugaa ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" /><char style="wj">Namni foon koo nyaatuu fi dhiiga koo dhugu hundi na keessa jiraata; anis isa keessa nan jiraadha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" /><char style="wj">Akkuma Abbaan jiraataan na ergee anis sababii Abbaatiin jiraadhu sana, namni na nyaatus sababii kootiin ni jiraata.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" /><char style="wj">Buddeenni shamaayʼun irraa buʼe isa kana; innis kan akka mannaa Abbootiin keessan nyaatanii duʼan sanaa miti; namni buddeena kana nyaatu bara baraan ni jiraata.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Innis Qifirnaahomitti utuu mana sagadaa keessatti barsiisaa jiruu waan kana dubbate.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barattoonni Baayʼeen Iisaa Dhiisanii Baqatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Barattoota isaa keessaa baayʼeen yommuu waan kana dhagaʼanitti, “Barsiisni kun cimaa dha; eenyutu fudhachuu dandaʼa?” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Iisaanis akka barattoonni isaa waaʼee waan kanaa guunguman hubatee akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Kun isin gufachiisaa ree?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" /><char style="wj">Yoos yoo utuu Ilmi Namaa iddoo dur turetti ol baʼuu argitan akkam taʼinna ree?</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" /><char style="wj">Kan jireenya kennu Hafuura; foon faayidaa hin qabu. Dubbiin ani isinitti dubbadhe Hafuura; jireenyas.</char> <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" /><char style="wj">Isin keessas warri hin amanne tokko tokko jiru.”</char> Iisaan jalqabumaa kaasee isaan keessaa eenyu akka hin amaninii fi eenyu akka dabarsee isa kennu ni beeka tureetii. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Innis ittuma fufee, <char style="wj">“Sababiin ani, ‘Yoo Abbaa biraa isaaf kenname malee namni kam iyyuu gara koo dhufuu hin dandaʼu’ isiniin jedheefis kanuma”</char> jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Yeroo kanaa jalqabee barattoota isaa keessaa baayʼeen duubatti deebiʼan; ergasiis isa wajjin hin deemne.<verse eid="JHN 6:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Iisaanis warra Kudha Lamaaniin, <char style="wj">“Isinis deemuu barbaadduu?”</char> jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoon Phexrosis akkana jedhee deebise; “Yaa Gooftaa, gara eenyuu deemna? Ati dubbii jireenya bara baraa qabdaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Nu akka ati Qulqullicha Allaaha taate amanneerra; beekneerras.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Iisaanis deebisee, <char style="wj">“Anumatu Kudha Lamaan keessan filate mitii? Taʼus isin keessaa inni tokko ibliisii dha!”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Innis waaʼee Yihuudaa ilma Simoon Keeriyotichaa dubbate; Yihuudaan warra Kudha Lamaan keessaa tokko taʼus Iisaa dabarsee kennuuf tureetii!<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Ayyaana Daasii Irratti Argamuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Kana booddee Iisaan Galiilaa keessa deddeebiʼaa ture; sababii Yihuudoonni isa ajjeesuu barbaadaniif inni Yihuudaa keessa hin deddeebine. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ayyaanni Daasii Yihuudootaa dhiʼaatee ture. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Obboloonni isaas akkana jedhaniin; “Akka barattoonni kee warri achii waan ati hojjettu arganiif kaʼiitii Yihuudaa dhaqi. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Namni utuu ifaan ifatti beekamuu barbaaduu dhoksaatti waa hojjetu hin jiruutii. Atis sababii waan kana hojjettuuf addunyaatti of mulʼisi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Obboloonni isaa iyyuu isatti hin amanne tureetii.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Iisaanis akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Yeroon koo amma illee hin geenye; isiniif garuu yeroon hundi mijaaʼaa dha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" /><char style="wj">Addunyaan isin jibbuu hin dandaʼu; ana garuu akka hojiin isaa hamaa taʼe waanan itti dhugaa baʼuuf na jibba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" /><char style="wj">Isin gara Ayyaana sanaa dhaqaa. Ani garuu waan yeroon koo amma illee hin gaʼiniif gara Ayyaanichaatti ol hin baʼu.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Inni waan kana isaanitti dubbatee Galiilaatti hafe.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Garuu erga obboloonni isaa gara Ayyaanichaatti ol baʼanii booddee innis utuu ifaan ifatti hin taʼin dhoksaadhaan ol baʼe. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Yihuudoonnis Ayyaanicha irratti, “Namichi sun eessa jira?” jedhanii gaafachaa isa barbaadaa turan.<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Namoota gidduuttis waaʼee isaa guungummii guddaatu ture. Namoonni tokko tokko, “Inni nama gaarii dha” jedhan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:12">Warri kaan immoo, “Akkas miti; inni nama dogoggorsa” jedhan. <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Garuu waan Yihuudoota sodaataniif namni tokko iyyuu ifaan ifatti waaʼee isaa hin dubbanne.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Ayyaana Irratti Barsiisuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Gara walakkaa Ayyaanichaattis Iisaan mana qulqullummaa seenee barsiisuu jalqabe. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Yihuudoonnis dinqifatanii, “Namichi kun akkamitti utuu hin baratin beekumsa akkanaa qabaate?” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Barsiisni koo kan isa na ergeeti malee kan koo miti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" /><char style="wj">Namni fedhii Allaaha gochuu barbaadu kam iyyuu barsiisni koo Allaah biraa dhufuu fi dhufuu baachuu isaa yookaan ani ofuma kootiin dubbachuu fi dubbachuu baachuu koo ni beeka.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" /><char style="wj">Namni ofuma isaatiin dubbatu inni ofuma isaatii ulfina argachuu barbaada; namni ulfina kan isa erge sanaa barbaadu garuu inni nama dhugaa ti; jalʼinnis isa keessa hin jiru.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" /><char style="wj">Muusaan seera isinii kenneera mitii? Isin keessaa garuu namni tokko iyyuu seera sana hin eegu. Isin maaliif na ajjeesuu barbaaddu?”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Jarris deebisanii, “Hafuura hamaatu si keessa jira; eenyutu si ajjeesuu barbaada?” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Iisaanis deebisee akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Ani hojii tokko hojjennaan hundi keessan dinqifattan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" /><char style="wj">Muusaan seera dhagna qabaa isinii kenne; dhagna qabaa garuu abbootiitu jalqabe malee Muusaa miti; isinis Sanbataan nama dhagna qabdu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" /><char style="wj">Akka seerri Muusaa hin cabneef erga namni tokko Sanbataan dhagna qabachuu dandaʼee, isin maaliif sababii ani Sanbataan dhagna namaa guutuu fayyiseef natti aartu?</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" /><char style="wj">Murtii qajeelaa kennaa malee, bifa qofa ilaaltanii hin murteessinaa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Kun inni Al-Masiihii dha?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Kana irratti namoota Yerusaalem keessaa tokko tokko akkana jedhan; “Inni kun namicha isaan ajjeesuuf barbaadan sana mitii? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Kunoo inni ifatti baʼee dubbata; isaanis homaa isaan hin jenne. Abbootiin taayitaa akka inni Al-Masiihii taʼe sirriitti beekaniiruu laata? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Taʼus namichi kun nama eessaa akka taʼe nu beekna. Al-Masiihiin yommuu dhufutti garuu inni eessaa akka dhufu namni tokko iyyuu hin beeku.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Iisaan utuu mana qulqullummaa keessatti barsiisuu sagalee isaa ol fudhatee akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Isin na beektu; akka ani eessaa dhufe illee beektu. Ani ofii kootiin hin dhufne; inni na erge sun dhuga qabeessa. Isin garuu isa hin beektan;</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" /><char style="wj">ani garuu sababiin isa biraa dhufee fi sababii inni na ergeef isa nan beeka.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Kana irratti isaan isa qabuu yaalan; garuu waan saʼaatiin isaa hin gaʼiniif namni tokko iyyuu harkaan isa hin tuqne. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Taʼus namoonni baayʼeen isatti amanan. Isaanis, “Al-Masiihiin yommuu dhufutti namicha kana caalaa mallattoo hojjetaa?” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Fariisonnis utuu namoonni waaʼee isaa waan akkanaa guungumanuu dhagaʼan. Luboonni hangafoonnii fi Fariisonni Iisaa qabsiisuudhaaf eegdota mana qulqullummaa ergan.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Iisaanis akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Ani yeroo gabaabaa isin wajjin jira; ergasii gara isa na erge sanaa nan dhaqa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" /><char style="wj">Isin na barbaaddu; garuu na hin argattan; iddoo ani jirus dhufuu hin dandeessan.”</char><verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Yihuudoonnis akkana waliin jedhan; “Namichi kun akka nu isa hin argineef eessa dhaquu yaade laata? Gara saba keenya warra Giriikota keessa faffacaʼanii dhaqee Giriikota barsiisaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" /><char style="wj">‘Isin na barbaaddu; garuu na hin argattan; iddoo ani jirus dhufuu hin dandeessan’</char> jechuun isaas maal jechuu isaatii?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Guyyaa Ayyaanichi itti hobbaʼu, guyyaa guddaa sana, Iisaan kaʼee dhaabatee sagalee guddaadhaan akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Eenyu iyyuu yoo dheebote, gara koo dhufee haa dhugu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" /><char style="wj">Akkuma Katabbiin Qulqulluun jedhe nama natti amanu kam iyyuu laga bishaan jireenyaatu garaa isaa keessaa burqa.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Kunis waaʼee Hafuura Qulqulluu warri isatti amanan argachuuf jiranii dubbachuu isaa ti. Sababii Iisaan amma illee ulfina hin argatiniif Hafuuri Qulqulluun hamma yeroo sanaatti hin kennamne tureetii.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Namoota sana keessaa tokko tokko yommuu dubbii kana dhagaʼanitti, “Kun dhugumaanuu Nabiiʼiyyicha” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Warri kaan immoo, “Inni Al-Masiihii dha” jedhan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Namoonni kaanis akkana jedhan; “Al-Masiihiin Galiilaadhaa dhufaa? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Akka Al-Masiihiin sanyii Daawud keessaa dhalatuu fi akka inni Beetlihemii, ganda Daawudii dhufu Katabbiin Qulqulluun ni dubbata mitii?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Akkasiin waaʼee Iisaan irratti garaa garummaan waldaa gidduutti uumame. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Isaan keessaas tokko tokko isa qabuu barbaadan; garuu namni tokko iyyuu harkaan isa hin tuqne.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amantii Dhabuu Dura Buʼoota Yihuudootaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Eegdonni sun gara luboota hangafootaatii fi gara Fariisotaatti deebiʼan; isaanis, “Isin maaliif isa hin fidin?” jedhanii eegdota sana gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Eegdonnis, “Takkumaa namni akka namicha kanaatti hin dubbanne” jedhanii deebisan.<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Fariisonnis deebisanii akkana jedhan, “Isinis gowwoomfamtaniirtuu? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Bulchitoota keessaa yookaan Fariisota keessaa namni tokko iyyuu isatti amaneeraa? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Sabni seera hin beekne kun garuu abaaramaa dha.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Niqoodemoos inni duraan Iisaa bira dhaqee fi isaan keessaas tokko taʼe sun akkana isaaniin jedhe; <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Seerri keenya utuu isa irraa hin dhagaʼin, waan inni hojjetes utuu hin beekin nama tokkotti ni muraa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Isaanis, “Atis nama Galiilaatii? Akka nabiiʼiyyiin Galiilaadhaa hin kaane qoradhuu bira gaʼi” jedhaniin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:52">[<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Ergasii isaan hundinuu gara mana isaaniitti galan.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Dubartii Ejja Irratti Qabamte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Iisaan garuu gara Tulluu Ejersaa dhaqe.<verse eid="JHN 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Ganama bariis deebiʼee mana qulqullummaa dhufe; innis namni hundumtuu isa biratti walitti qabamnaan taaʼee isaan barsiise. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Barsiistonni seeraatii fi Fariisonni dubartii ejja irratti qabamte tokko isatti fidan. Gidduu isaaniis dhaabachiisanii, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Iisaadhaan akkana jedhan; “Yaa barsiisaa, dubartiin kun utuu ejja hojjettuu qabamte. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Muusaan Seera keessatti akka warri akkanaa dhagaadhaan tumaman nu ajajeera. Ati immoo maal jetta?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Isaanis waan ittiin isa himatan argachuuf jedhanii isa qoruudhaaf waan kana gaafatan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:6">Iisaan garuu gad jedhee quba isaatiin lafa irratti barreessuu jalqabe. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Isaanis ittuma fufanii isa gaafannaan ol jedhee, <char style="wj">“Isin keessaa namni cubbuu hin qabne dursee isheetti dhagaa haa darbatu”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ammas gad jedhee lafa irratti barreesse.<verse eid="JHN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Isaanis yommuu kana dhagaʼanitti maanguddootaa jalqabanii tokko tokkoon baʼanii sokkan; Iisaan immoo dubartittii achuma dhaabattee jirtu wajjin kophaa hafe. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Iisaanis ol jedhee, <char style="wj">“Dubartii nana, warri si himatan meerre? Namni tokko iyyuu sitti hin murree?”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Isheenis, “Yaa Gooftaa, namni tokko iyyuu natti hin murre” jetteen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Anis sitti hin muruu deemi; garuu siʼachi cubbuu hin hojjetin”</char> jedheen.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Waraabbileen durii hedduun kutaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 7:53-8:11">Yoh 7:53–8:11</ref></char>) hin qaban yookaan iddoo biraa yookaan immoo injiilota biraa keessa seensisan.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan ifa addunyaa ti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Iisaan ammas, <char style="wj">“Ani ifa addunyaa ti. Namni na duukaa buʼu kam iyyuu ifa jireenyaa qabaata malee dukkana keessa hin deddeebiʼu”</char> jedhee isaanitti dubbate.<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Fariisonnis, “Ati waaʼee mataa keetii dhugaa baata; dhuga baʼumsi kee immoo dhugaa miti” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebise; <char style="wj">“Ani yoon ofii kootiif dhugaa baʼe illee ani akkan eessaa dhufee fi akkan garam deemu waanan beekuuf dhuga baʼumsi koo dhugaa dha. Isin garuu akka ani eessaa dhufe yookaan akka ani garam deemu hin beektan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" /><char style="wj">Isin akka yaada fooniitti murteessitu; ani nama tokkotti illee hin muru.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" /><char style="wj">Garuu ani yoon mure illee murtiin koo dhugaa dha; kan murus na qofa miti. Ani Abbaa na erge sana wajjinan jiraatii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" /><char style="wj">Dhuga baʼumsi nama lamaa akka dhugaa taʼe Seera keessan keessatti barreeffameera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" /><char style="wj">Ani ofii kootiif dhugaa nan baʼa; Abbaan na erges waaʼee koo dhugaa baʼa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Isaanis, “Abbaan kee eessa jira?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Iisaan immoo deebisee, <char style="wj">“Isin anas, Abbaa koos hin beektan; utuu na beektanii silaa Abbaa koos ni beektu turtan”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Iisaan utuu mana qulqullummaa keessatti, kutaa buusiin itti kuufamu keessatti barsiisaa jiruu dubbii kana dubbate. Garuu waan saʼaatiin isaa hin gaʼiniif namni tokko iyyuu isa hin qabne.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Iisaan amma illee, <char style="wj">“Ani nan deema; isin na barbaaddu; cubbuu keessaniinis ni duutu. Isin iddoo ani dhaqu dhufuu hin dandeessan”</char> isaaniin jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Yihuudoonnis, “ ‘Isin iddoo ani dhaqu dhufuu hin dandeessan’ jechuun isaa of ajjeesuufii laata?” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Innis ittuma fufee akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Isin kan gadii ti; ani kan olii ti. Isin kan addunyaa kanaa ti; ani immoo kan addunyaa kanaa miti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" /><char style="wj">Akka isin cubbuu keessaniin duutan ani isinitti himeera; isin yoo akka ani isa taʼe amanuu baattan, cubbuu keessaniin ni duutu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Isaanis, “Ati eenyu?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Iisaan immoo akkana jedhee deebise; <char style="wj">“Ani isuma jalqabaa kaasee isinitti dubbachaa turee dha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" /><char style="wj">Ani waaʼee keessan waanan jedhuu fi waanan murteessu baayʼeen qaba. Garuu inni na erge dhugaa qabeessa; anis waanan isa irraa dhagaʼe addunyaatti nan hima.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Isaan garuu akka inni waaʼee Abbaa isaa isaanitti himaa ture hin hubanne. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Kanaafuu Iisaan akkana isaaniin jedhe; <char style="wj">“Yommuu Ilma Namaa ol fuutanitti akka ani isa taʼe, waanuma Abbaan na barsiisen dubbadha malee akka ani ofii kootiin homaa hin hojjennees ni beektu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" /><char style="wj">Inni na erge na wajjin jira; sababii ani yeroo hunda waan isa gammachiisu hojjedhuuf, inni kophaa koo na hin dhiifne.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Utuma inni dubbatuus, namoonni baayʼeen isatti amanan.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ijoollee Ibraahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Iisaan Yihuudoota isatti amananiin akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Yoo dubbii kootti cichitanii jiraattan isin dhuguma barattoota koo ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" /><char style="wj">Dhugaas ni beektu; dhugaanis bilisa isin baasa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Isaanis, “Nu sanyii Ibraahim; nu eenyumaafuu takkumaa hin garboomne. Yoos ati akkamitti bilisa baatu nuun jetta ree?” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Iisaanis deebisee akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; namni cubbuu hojjetu hundi garbicha cubbuu ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" /><char style="wj">Garbichi bara baraan mana hin jiraatu; ilmi garuu bara baraan ni jiraata.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" /><char style="wj">Kanaafuu yoo Ilmi bilisa isin baase, isin dhugumaan bilisa ni baatu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" /><char style="wj">Isin sanyii Ibraahim taʼuu keessan anuu beeka. Garuu sababii dubbiin koo isin keessatti iddoo hin qabneef na ajjeesuu barbaaddu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" /><char style="wj">Ani waanan Abbaa koo biratti argen dubbadha; isinis waanuma abbaa keessan irraa dhageessan hojjettu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Isaanis, “Abbaan keenya Ibraahim” jedhan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Iisaan immoo akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Isin utuu ijoollee Ibraahim taatanii silaa hojii Ibraahim hojjete ni hojjettu turtan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" /><char style="wj">Isin garuu ana nama dhugaa Allaah irraa dhagaʼe isinitti hime ajjeesuu barbaaddu. Ibraahim waan akkasii hin hojjenne.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" /><char style="wj">Isin waan abbaan keessan hojjete hojjettu.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Isaanis, “Nu ejjaan hin dhalanne. Abbaa tokkicha qabna; innis Allaah” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ijoollee Ibliis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Iisaanis akkana isaaniin jedhe; <char style="wj">“Isin utuu Allaahan abbaa keessan taʼee silaa na jaallattu turtan; ani Allaah biraa baʼeen dhufeetii. Isatu na erge malee ani ofii kootiin hin dhufne.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" /><char style="wj">Wanni ani dubbadhu maaliif isinii hin galu? Sababiin isaas waan isin waan ani jedhu fudhachuu hin feeneef.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" /><char style="wj">Isin ijoollee abbaa keessanii ijoollee ibliis; fedhiin keessanis hawwii abbaa keessanii raawwachuu dha. Inni jalqabumaa kaasee nama ajjeesaa ture; waan dhugaan isa keessa hin jirreef inni dhugaadhaan hin jiraatu. Inni sobduu fi abbaa sobaa waan taʼeef yommuu soba dubbatutti ofuma keessaa fuudhee dubbata.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" /><char style="wj">Isin garuu waan ani dhugaa dubbadhuuf na hin amantan!</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" /><char style="wj">Isin keessaa namni cubbuudhaan na himatu eenyu? Erga ani dhugaa dubbadhee, isin maaliif na hin amanne?</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" /><char style="wj">Namni kan Allaaha taʼe kam iyyuu dubbii Allaaha ni dhagaʼa. Isin waan kan Allaaha hin taʼiniif hin dhageessan.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Waaʼee Ofii Isaa Dubbate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Yihuudoonnis deebisanii, “Ati nama Samaariyaa ti; hafuura hamaatu si keessa jira jechuun keenya dhugaa mitii?” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Hafuurri hamaan na keessa hin jiru; ani Abbaa koo nan kabaja; isin garuu na hin kabajjan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" /><char style="wj">Ani ulfina mataa koo hin barbaadu; garuu kan isa barbaadu tokkotu jira; innis Abbaa murtii ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; eenyu iyyuu yoo dubbii koo eege bara baraan duʼa hin argu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Yihuudoonnis akkana jedhaniin; “Akka hafuurri hamaan si keessa jiru nu amma barreerra. Ibraahim duʼeera; nabiiʼiyyoonnis duʼaniiru; ati garuu, ‘Eenyu iyyuu yoo dubbii koo eege bara baraan duʼa hin dhandhamu’ jetta. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ati abbaa keenya Ibraahim caaltaa? Inni duʼeera; nabiiʼiyyoonnis duʼaniiru. Egaa ati eenyu ofiin jetta ree?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Iisaan akkana jedhee deebise; <char style="wj">“Ani yoon ofii kootiif ulfina kenne, ulfinni koo gatii hin qabu. Kan ulfina naa kennu Abbaa koo isuma isin Allaah keenya jettaniin sanaa dha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" /><char style="wj">Yoo isin isa beekuu baattan illee ani isa beeka. Ani utuu isa hin beeku jedhee silaa akkuma keessan sobduu nan taʼa ture. Ani garuu isa beeka; dubbii isaa illee nan eega.</char> <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" /><char style="wj">Abbaan keessan Ibraahim guyyaa koo arguuf gammadee ture; innis ni arge; ni gammades.”</char><verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Yihuudoonnis, “Umuriin kee waggaa shantama iyyuu hin guunne; yoos Ibraahimin argiteertaa?” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; utuu Ibraahim hin dhalatin iyyuu ani anuma”</char> isaaniin jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Kana irratti isaan isa dhaʼuuf jedhanii dhagaa guurratan; Iisaan garuu dhokatee mana qulqullummaatii baʼee deeme.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Namicha Jaamaa Tokko Fayyisuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Iisaan utuu darbuu namicha dhalootuma isaatii jalqabee jaamaa ture tokko arge. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Barattoonni isaas, “Yaa barsiisaa, akka namichi kun jaamaa taʼee dhalatuuf eenyutu cubbuu hojjete? Isuma moo abbaa fi haadha isaa ti?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebise; <char style="wj">“Akka hojiin Allaaha isaan mulʼatuuf malee inni yookaan abbaa fi haati isaa cubbuu hojjetanii miti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" /><char style="wj">Utuu guyyaa taʼee jiruu hojii isa na ergee hojjechuun qabna. Halkan namni tokko iyyuu itti hojjechuu hin dandeenye ni dhufa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" /><char style="wj">Ani yommuun addunyaa irra jiru, ifa addunyaa ti.”</char><verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Innis erga waan kana dubbatee booddee lafatti tufee dhoqqee tolche; dhoqqee sanas ija namichaatti dibe. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Innis namicha sanaan, <char style="wj">“Dhaqiitii Haroo Saliihoomitti dhiqadhu”</char> jedhe. Saliihoom jechuun kan ergame jechuu dha. Namichis dhaqee dhiqate; argaas deebiʼee dhufe.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Olloonni isaatii fi namoonni duraan utuu inni kadhatuu argan, “Namichi kun isuma taaʼee kadhachaa ture sana mitii?” jedhan. <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Namoonni tokko tokko, “Eeyyee, isa” jedhan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Kaan immoo, “Miti, isa fakkaata malee” jedhan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Inni garuu, “Namichi sun anuma” jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Jarris, “Iji kee akkamitti baname ree?” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Innis deebisee, “Namicha Iisaa jedhamutu dhoqqee tolchee ija koo dibee, ‘Gara Haroo Saliihoom dhaqiitii dhiqadhu’ naan jedhe; anis dhaqeen dhiqadhe; arguus nan dandaʼe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Isaanis, “Namichi sun eessa jira?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Inni immoo, “Ani hin beeku” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fariisonni Waaʼee Fayyuu Namichaa Qorachuu Isaanii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Isaanis namicha jaamaa ture sana Fariisotatti geessan. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Guyyaan itti Iisaan dhoqqee tolchee ija namichaa bane Sanbata ture. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Fariisonnis namichi akkamitti akka arguu dandaʼe isa gaafatan; namichis, “Inni dhoqqee tolchee ija koo dibe; anis nan dhiqadhe; nan arges” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Fariisota keessaas tokko tokko, “Namichi kun waan Sanbata hin eegneef, inni Allaah biraa hin dhufne” jedhan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Warri kaan garuu, “Cubbamaan tokko akkamitti dinqii akkanaa hojjechuu dandaʼa?” jedhan. Garaa garummaanis isaan gidduutti uumame.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Isaanis amma illee namicha jaamaa ture sanaan, “Waaʼee namicha ija kee siif bane sanaa maal jetta?” jedhan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Namichis deebisee, “Inni nabiiʼiyyii dha” jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Yihuudoonnis hamma abbaa fi haadha namicha agartuu isaa argate sanaa waamanitti akka inni jaamaa turee fi akka inni agartuu isaa argate amma illee hin amanne. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Isaanis, “Inni kun ilma keessan isuma isin jaamaa taʼee dhalate jettan sanaa? Yoos amma immoo akkamitti arguu dandaʼa ree?” jedhanii gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Abbaa fi haati namichaas deebisanii akkana jedhan; “Akka inni ilma keenya taʼee fi akka inni jaamaa taʼee dhalate ni beekna. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Garuu amma akkamitti akka arguu dandaʼe yookaan ija isaa eenyu akka baneef nu hin beeknu. Inni nama gaʼaa dha; waaʼee mataa isaa dubbachuu ni dandaʼa; isuma gaafadhaa.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Abbaa fi haati isaa sababii Yihuudoota sodaataniif waan kana jedhan; namni kam iyyuu yoo Iisaan inni Al-Masiihii jedhee dhugaa baʼe akka mana sagadaa keessaa ariʼamu Yihuudoonni kanaan dura walii galanii murteessanii turaniitii. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Kanaafuu abbaa fi haati isaa, “Inni nama gaʼaa dha; isuma gaafadhaa” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Isaanis yeroo lammaffaa namicha jaamaa ture sana waamanii, “Allaahaf ulfina kenni. Namichi kun cubbamaa taʼuu isaa nu ni beekna” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Innis, “Cubbamaa taʼuu fi taʼuu baachuu isaa ani hin beeku. Ani waan tokkon beeka. Ani jaamaan ture; amma garuu nan arga!” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Isaanis, “Inni maal siif godhe? Ija kees akkamitti siif bane?” jedhanii isa gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Inni immoo, “Ani kanaan dura isinitti himeera; isinis hin dhageenye. Ammas maaliif dhagaʼuu barbaaddu? Isinis barattoota isaa taʼuu barbaadduu?” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Isaanis akkana jedhanii isa arrabsan; “Barataan namicha kanaa siʼi! Nu barattoota Muusaa ti! <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Akka Allaahan Muusaatti dubbate nu beekna; namichi kun garuu eessaa akka dhufe iyyuu hin beeknu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Namichis deebisee akkana jedhe; “Inni eessaa akka dhufe wallaaluun keessan waan nama dinquu dha; garuu inni ija koo naa bane. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Akka Allaahan cubbamoota hin dhageenye ni beekna. Inni nama isa waaqeffatuu fi fedhii isaa guutu dhagaʼa. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Eenyu iyyuu ija nama jaamaa taʼee dhalate tokkoo akka bane uumama addunyaatii jalqabee hin dhagaʼamne. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Namichi kun utuu Allaah biraa taʼuu baatee silaa homaa gochuu hin dandaʼu ture.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Isaanis deebisanii, “Ati kan guutummaatti cubbuun dhalatte, situ nu barsiisaa?” jedhaniin. Alattis gad isa baasan.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jaamummaa Hafuuraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Iisaanis akka isaan gad isa baasan dhagaʼe; yommuu isa argettis, <char style="wj">“Ati Ilma Namaatti ni amantaa?”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Namichis, “Yaa gooftaa, akka ani isatti amanuuf inni eenyu?” jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Ati amma isa argiteerta; inni si wajjin haasaʼaa jiru isuma”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Namichi sunis, “Yaa Gooftaa, ani nan amana” jedhe; ni sagadeefis.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Iisaan immoo, <char style="wj">“Warri hin argine akka arganiif, warri argan immoo akka jaamaniif ani murtiif gara addunyaa kanaa dhufeera”</char> jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Fariisota isa wajjin turan keessaa tokko tokko waan kana jechuu isaa dhagaʼanii, “Nus jaamota mitii ree?” jedhanii gaafatan.<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Utuu jaamota taatanii silaa cubbuu hin qabdan ture; isin garuu, ‘Ni argina’ jettu; cubbuun keessan ni jiraata”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Tiksee Gaarii fi Hoolota Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; namni balbalaan gola hoolotaa hin seennee, garuu karaa biraatiin koree seenu inni hattuu fi saamtuu dha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" /><char style="wj">Namni balbalaan seenu immoo tiksee hoolotaa ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" /><char style="wj">Eegduunis balbala isaaf bana; hoolonnis sagalee isaa ni dhagaʼu. Innis hoolota isaa maqaa maqaan waamee gad yaasa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" /><char style="wj">Erga warra kan isaa taʼan hunda gad yaasee booddee isaan dura deema; hoolonni isaas waan sagalee isaa beekaniif isa faana buʼu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" /><char style="wj">Orma garuu ni baqatu malee faana hin buʼan; sagalee ormaa hin beekaniitii.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Iisaan fakkeenya kana isaanitti hime; isaan garuu akka inni maal isaanitti himaa ture hin hubanne.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Kanaafuu Iisaan ammas akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; ani balbala hoolotaa ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" /><char style="wj">Warri na dura dhufan hundi hattootaa fi saamtota; hoolonni garuu isaan hin dhageenye.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" /><char style="wj">Balballi ana; namni karaa kootiin ol seenu kam iyyuu ni fayya. Inni ni seena; ni baʼas; lafa dheedaas ni argata.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" /><char style="wj">Hattichi hatuuf, ajjeesuu fi balleessuu qofaaf dhufa; ani garuu akka isaan jireenya qabaataniif, jireenya irraa hafaas akka qabaataniif dhufeera.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />
    <char style="wj">“Tikseen gaariin ana. Tikseen gaariin hoolota isaatiif jedhee lubbuu isaa dabarsee kenna.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" /><char style="wj">Namni qacaramaan kan tiksee hin taʼin garuu waan hoolonni kan isaa hin taʼiniif yommuu dhufaatii yeeyyii argutti hoolota dhiisee baqata. Yeeyyiinis bushaayee ni butata; ni bittinneessas.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" /><char style="wj">Namichi waan qacaramaa taʼeef ni baqata; dhimma hoolotaas hin qabu.</char><verse eid="JHN 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />
    <char style="wj">“Tikseen gaariin ana; ani hoolota koo beeka; hoolonni koos na beeku;</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" /><char style="wj">kunis akkuma Abbaan na beekuttii fi akkuma ani Abbaa beekutti. Anis lubbuu koo hoolotaaf nan kenna.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" /><char style="wj">Ani warra gola kanatti galan malees hoolota gara biraan qaba. Isaanis fiduun qaba. Isaanis sagalee koo ni dhagaʼu; karra tokkos ni taʼu; tikseen isaaniis tokko taʼa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" /><char style="wj">Kanaafuu Abbaan waan ani deebisee fudhachuuf lubbuu koo dabarsee kennuuf na jaallata.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" /><char style="wj">Lubbuu koo anumatu ofii kootiin dabarsee kenna malee eenyu iyyuu narraa hin fudhatu. Ani lubbuu koo dabarsee kennuuf taayitaan qaba; deebisee fudhachuufis taayitaan qaba. Ajaja kanas Abbaa koo biraa fudhadheera.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Amma illee sababii dubbii kanaatiif Yihuudoota gidduutti garaa garummaan uumame. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Baayʼeen isaaniis, “Hafuura hamaatu isa keessa jira; inni maraateera. Isin maaliif isa dhageessu?” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Warri kaan immoo, “Kun jecha nama hafuura hamaadhaan qabame miti. Hafuurri hamaan ija nama jaamaa banuu ni dandaʼaa?” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amantii Dhabuu Yihuudootaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Yeroo sana Ayyaanni mana qulqullummaa haaromsuu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ayyaanni mana qulqullummaa haaromsuu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hanukkaa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jedhamee beekama </char><char style="ft" closed="false">– Jiʼi Hanukkaa Sadaasaa wajjin tokkuma. Ayyaanni kunis guyyaa itti Yihuudaa Maqaabiis (dhaloota Al-Masiihii dura bara 164 keessa) mana qulqullummaa kan namoonni Sooriyaa waggaa sadii xureessan sana haaromse yaadachuuf godhame. Ayyaanichis guyyaa digdamii shanaffaa jiʼa sanaa irraa jalqabee hamma guyyaa saddeetiitti ayyaaneffama ture. Yeroon kun Yihuudootaaf yeroo gammachuu guddaa ture.</char></note> Yerusaalemitti ayyaaneffamee ture. Yeroon sunis ganna ture; <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Iisaanis mana qulqullummaa keessa gardaafoo Suleyimaan keessa deddeebiʼaa ture. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Yihuudoonnis isa marsanii, “Hamma yoomiitti qalbii nu rarraaftaa? Ati yoo Al-Masiihii taate ifatti baasii nutti himi” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Ani isinitti himeera; isin garuu hin amantan. Hojiin ani maqaa Abbaa kootiitiin hojjedhu waaʼee koo dhugaa baʼa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" /><char style="wj">Isin garuu waan hoolota koo hin taʼiniif hin amantan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" /><char style="wj">Hoolonni koo sagalee koo ni dhagaʼu; anis isaan beeka; isaanis na faana buʼu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" /><char style="wj">Anis jireenya bara baraa nan kennaaf; isaanis gonkumaa hin badan. Eenyu iyyuu harka koo keessaa isaan hin butatu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" /><char style="wj">Abbaan koo kan natti isaan kenne sun hunduma caala; namni tokko iyyuu harka Abbaa kootii keessaa isaan butachuu hin dandaʼu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" /><char style="wj">Anii fi Abbaan tokkuma.”</char><verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Yihuudoonni isa dhaʼuuf jedhanii ammas dhagaa guurratan. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Ani hojii Abbaa kootii gaarii baayʼee isinitti argisiiseera. Hojii kana keessaa isin sababii isa kamiitiif dhagaadhaan na dhooftu?”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Yihuudoonnis, “Nu hojii gaariif jennee dhagaadhaan si hin dhoofnu; garuu waan ati Allaah arrabsitee utumaa nama taatee jirtuu Allaah of gooteef si dhoofna” jedhanii deebisaniif.<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Seera keessan keessatti, ‘Anuu isin, “waaqeffatamtoota” jedheera’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Zab 82:6</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">jedhamee barreeffameera mitii?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" /><char style="wj">Inni erga warra dubbiin Allaaha isaaniif dhufeen ‘waaqeffatamtoota’ jedhee, Katabbiin Qulqulluun immoo waan hin diigamneef,</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" /><char style="wj">sababii ani, ‘Ani ilma Allaaha ti’ jedheef, isin maaliif isa Abbaan qulqulleessee gara addunyaatti erge sanaan ‘Ati Allaah arrabsita’ jettu?</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" /><char style="wj">Yoo ani hojii Abbaa kootii hojjechuu baadhe na hin amaninaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" /><char style="wj">Yoo ani hojii sana hojjedhe garuu yoo na amanuu baattan illee hojicha amanaa; kunis akka Abbaan na keessa jiru, akka anis Abbaa keessa jiru beektanii akka hubattaniif.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Isaan amma illee isa qabuu barbaadan; inni garuu isaan harkaa miliqe.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Iisaan ergasii deebiʼee Yordaanos gama iddoo Yahyaa jalqabatti itti cuuphaa ture sana dhaqee achis ture. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Namoonni baayʼeenis gara isaa dhufanii, “Yahyaan mallattoo tokko illee hin hojjenne; garuu wanni inni waaʼee namicha kanaa dubbate hundinuu dhugaa dha” jedhan. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Achittis namoonni hedduun Iisaatti amanan.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Duʼuu Alʼaazaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Namichi Alʼaazaar jedhamu kan Biitaaniyaa keessa jiraatu tokko dhukkubsatee ture. Biitaaniyaan ganda Mariyaamii fi obboleettiin ishee Maartaan keessa jiraatanii dha. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mariyaam isheen obboleessi ishee Alʼaazaar dhukkubsate kun, isheedhuma Gooftaa shittoo dibdee rifeensa mataa isheetiin miilla isaa haqxee sanaa dha. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Kanaaf obboleettonni isaa, “Yaa Gooftaa, inni ati jaallattu kunoo dhukkubsatee jira” jedhanii Iisaatti dhaaman.<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Iisaanis yommuu waan kana dhagaʼetti, <char style="wj">“Dhibeen kun akka Ilmi Allaaha ittiin ulfaatuuf, ulfina Allaahatiif dhufe malee duʼaan hin gaʼu”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Iisaanis Maartaa fi obboleettii ishee, Alʼaazaarinis ni jaallata ture. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Innis yommuu akka Alʼaazaar dhukkubsate dhagaʼetti guyyaa lama idduma jiru sana ture. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Innis ergasii barattoota isaatiin, <char style="wj">“Kottaa Yihuudaatti deebinaa”</char> jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Barattoonni isaa immoo, “Yaa Barsiisaa, Yihuudoonni dhiʼeenya kana dhagaadhaan si tumuu barbaadaa turan; ati amma illee deebitee achi dhaqxaa?” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Guyyaan tokko saʼaatii kudha lama qaba mitii? Namni guyyaan deemu waan ifa addunyaa kanaatiin arguuf hin gufatu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" /><char style="wj">Kan halkaniin deemu garuu sababii ifni isa keessa hin jirreef ni gufata.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Innis erga waan kana dubbatee booddee, <char style="wj">“Michuun keenya Alʼaazaar rafeera; ani garuu hirribaa isa kaasuu nan dhaqa”</char> isaaniin jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Barattoonni isaas, “Yaa Gooftaa, yoo rafee jiraate ni fayya” jedhaniin. <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Iisaan waaʼee duʼa Alʼaazaar dubbate; barattoonni isaa garuu waan inni waaʼee rafiitii hirribaa dubbate seʼan.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Kanaafuu Iisaan akkana jedhee ifatti baasee isaanitti hime; <char style="wj">“Alʼaazaar duʼeera;</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" /><char style="wj">akka isin amantaniif ani waan achi hin turiniif waaʼee keessaniif nan gammada. Taʼus kottaa gara isaa dhaqnaa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Toomaas inni Didimoos jedhamu immoo barattoota kaaniin, “Nus akka isa wajjin duunuuf kaʼaa ni dhaqnaa” jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Obboleettota Alʼaazaar Jajjabeessuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Iisaan yommuu achi gaʼetti Alʼaazaar erga qabbaramee guyyaa afur akka ture beeke. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Biitaaniyaan Yerusaalem irraa gara kiiloo meetira sadii fagaatti turte; <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Yihuudoonni baayʼeen Maartaa fi Mariyaamin sababii obboleessa isaaniitiif isaan jajjabeessuu dhaqanii turan. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Maartaan yommuu dhufaatii Iisaa dhageessetti isa simachuu gad baate; Mariyaam garuu mana teesse.<verse eid="JHN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Maartaanis Iisaadhaan akkana jette; “Yaa Gooftaa, utuu ati as jiraattee silaa obboleessi koo hin duʼu ture. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ammas taanaan akka waan ati Allaah duratti duʼaa godhattu hunda Allaahan siif kennu nan beeka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Obboleessi kee ni kaʼa”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Maartaanis deebiftee, “Akka inni duʼaa kaʼuu guyyaa dhumaa sanatti kaʼu anuu beeka” jetteen.<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Iisaan immoo akkana isheedhaan jedhe; <char style="wj">“Duʼaa kaʼuu fi jireenyi ana. Namni natti amanu yoo duʼe iyyuu ni jiraata;</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" /><char style="wj">kan na keessa jiraatuu fi kan natti amanu hundinuu bara baraan hin duʼu. Kana ni amantaa ree?”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Isheenis, “Eeyyee yaa Gooftaa, akka ati Al-Masiihi Ilma Allaaha kan gara addunyaa dhufu sana taate nan amana” jetteen.<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Isheenis erga akkas jettee dhaqxee obboleettii ishee Mariyaamin kophaatti waamtee, “Barsiisaan dhufeera; si waamas” jetteen. <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Mariyaamis yommuu waan kana dhageessetti ariitiin kaatee gara isaa dhaqxe. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Iisaan yeroo sana iddoo Maartaan itti isa simatte ture malee amma illee ganda sana hin seenne. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Yihuudoonni Mariyaamin jajjabeessaa mana keessa ishee wajjin turanis yommuu akka isheen ariitiidhaan kaatee gad baate arganitti waan isheen achitti booʼuuf jettee gara qabrii dhaqxu seʼanii ishee duukaa buʼan.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mariyaamis yommuu iddoo Iisaan ture sana geessee isa argitetti, miilla isaa irratti kuftee, “Yaa Gooftaa utuu ati as jiraattee silaa obboleessi koo hin duʼu ture” jetteen.<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Iisaanis yommuu booʼuu ishee, Yihuudoonni ishee wajjin dhufanis booʼuu isaanii argetti hafuuraan akka malee jeeqame; ni dhiphates. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Innis, <char style="wj">“Eessa isa keessan?”</char> jedhee isaan gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Isaanis, “Yaa Gooftaa, kottuu ilaali” jedhaniin.<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Iisaanis imimmaan dhangalaase.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Yihuudoonnis, “Inni hammam akka isa jaallatu mee ilaalaa!” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Isaan keessaa tokko tokko garuu, “Inni kan ija namicha jaamaa sanaa bane, akka namichi kunis hin duune gochuu hin dandaʼu turee?” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Alʼaazaarin Duʼaa Kaase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Iisaan ammas akka malee jeeqamee gara qabrii sanaa dhaqe. Qabriin sunis holqa balballi isaa dhagaadhaan cufame tokko ture. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Dhagaa kana achi irraa fuudhaa!”</char> jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Maartaan obboleettiin isa duʼe sanaa garuu, “Yaa Gooftaa, inni erga qabbaramee waan guyyaa afur tureef yoona ni ajaaʼa” jetteen.<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Iisaan immoo, <char style="wj">“Ati yoo amante akka ulfina Allaaha argitu ani sitti hin himnee?”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Kanaafuu isaan dhagicha irraa kaasan. Iisaanis ol ilaalee akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Yaa Abbaa, waan ati na dhageesseef sin galateeffadha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" /><char style="wj">Akka ati yeroo hunda na dhageessu ani beekeera; garuu akka namoonni as dhadhaabatan kunneen akka ati na ergite amananiif ani isaaniif jedheen waan kana dubbadhe.”</char><verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Iisaanis waan kana dubbatee, <char style="wj">“Alʼaazaar, as baʼi!”</char> jedhee sagalee guddaadhaan iyye. <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Namichi duʼe sunis akkuma harki isaatii fi miilli isaa huccuudhaan kafanamee, fuulli isaas wayyaadhaan marametti gad baʼe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Isa hiikaa, haa deemu”</char> isaaniin jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mala Iisaa Ajjeesuuf Malatame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Kanaafuu Yihuudoota gara Mariyaam dhufanii waan Iisaan hojjete argan keessaa hedduun isatti amanan. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Isaan keessaa tokko tokko garuu Fariisota bira dhaqanii waan Iisaan hojjete itti himan. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Kana irratti luboonni hangafoonnii fi Fariisonni yaaʼii Yihuudootaa waaman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:47">Isaanis akkana jedhanii gaafatan; “Namichi kun mallattoo baayʼee argisiisaa jira. Maal haa goonu? <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Yoo akkasumatti isa dhiifne namni hundi isatti amana; warri Roomaas dhufanii iddoo keenyaa fi saba keenya nurraa fudhatu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Isaan keessaas namichi Qayyaaffaa jedhamu kan bara sana luba ol aanaa ture tokko akkana isaaniin jedhe; “Isin waan tokko illee hin beektan! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Sabni guutummaatti dhumuu irra namni tokko sabaaf duʼuun akka isinii wayyu hin hubattan.”<verse eid="JHN 11:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Inni bara sana waan luba ol aanaa tureef, akka Iisaan saba sanaaf duʼu raajii dubbachuu isaati malee dubbii kana of keessaa fuudhee hin dubbanne; <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />kunis ijoollee Allaaha kanneen bittinnaaʼan walitti qabee tokko gochuuf malee saba sana qofaaf miti. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Kanaafuu isaan gaafasii jalqabanii isa ajjeesuuf malachaa turan.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Kanaafuu Iisaan ifatti baʼee Yihuudoota gidduu hin deddeebine. Achii kaʼee gara magaalaa Efreem jedhamu kan gammoojjiitti dhiʼaatu tokkoo dhaqe; barattoota isaa wajjinis achi ture.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Faasiikaan Yihuudootaa waan dhiʼaatee tureef, namoonni hedduun utuu Faasiikaan hin gaʼin of qulqulleessuuf jedhanii baadiyyaadhaa Yerusaalemitti ol baʼan. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Isaanis Iisaa barbaadaa turan; mana qulqullummaa keessas dhaabatanii, “Isin maal seetu? Inni gara Ayyaana kanaa hin dhufuu laata?” waliin jedhan. <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Luboonni hangafoonnii fi Fariisonni garuu Iisaa qabuuf jedhanii namni iddoo inni jiru beeku yoo jiraate akka isaanitti himuuf ajaja kennanii turan.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Biitaaniyaatti Shittoo Dibame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">12:1‑8</ref> kwi – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6‑13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14:3‑9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:37-39">Luq 7:37‑39</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Faasiikaa dura guyyaa jaʼaffaatti Iisaan gara Biitaaniyaa ganda Alʼaazaar, kan Iisaan duʼaa isa kaase sun jiraachaa turee dhaqe. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Achitti irbaata qopheessaniif. Maartaanis ni tajaajilti turte; Alʼaazaaris warra isa wajjin irbaatatti dhiʼaatan keessaa tokko ture. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mariyaamis shittoo Naardoos qulqulluu gatiin isaa guddaa kan gara liitirii walakkaa taʼu fiddee miilla Iisaa dibde; rifeensa mataa isheetiinis miilla isaa haqxe. Manichis urgaa shittoo sanaatiin guutame.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Barattoota isaa keessaa tokko kan dabarsee isa kennuuf jiru Yihuudaa Keeriyotichi garuu akkana jedhe; <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Shittoon kun maaliif diinaarii dhibba sadiitti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Diinaariin dhibba sadii mindaa hojjetaan tokko waggaatti argatuu dha.</char></note> gurguramee hiyyeeyyiif hin kennamne?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Akkana jechuun isaa waan hattuu tureef malee hiyyeeyyiif yaade miti. Innis sababii korojoon maallaqaa harka isaa tureef, waan achi keessa buufamu irraa ofii isaatii fudhachaa ture.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Iisaanis deebisee akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Isheen shittoo kana guyyaa qabrii kootiitiif haa tursituutii ishee dhiisaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" /><char style="wj">Hiyyeeyyii yeroo hunda of biraa qabdu; ana garuu yeroo hunda of biraa hin qabdan.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Yihuudoonni baayʼeen akka Iisaan achi jiru beekanii Iisaa qofaaf jedhaanii utuu hin taʼin, Alʼaazaar isa inni duʼaa kaases ilaaluuf dhufan. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Kanaafuu luboonni hangafoonni Alʼaazaarinis ajjeesuuf mariʼatan; <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Yihuudoota keessaa namoonni baayʼeen sababii isaatiif dhaqanii Iisaatti amanaa turaniitii.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Akka Mootiitti Yerusaalem Seenuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 12:12-15">12:12‑15</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 21:4-9">Mat 21:4‑9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:7-10">Mar 11:7‑10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:35-38">Luq 19:35‑38</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Guyyaa itti aanutti namoonni Ayyaanichaaf dhufanii turan baayʼeen akka Iisaan gara Yerusaalem dhufaa jiru dhagaʼan. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Isaanis damee meexxii harkatti qabatanii isa simachuu baʼan; iyyaniis akkana jedhan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hoosaaʼinaa!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hoosaaʼinaa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jechuun afaan Ibraayisxiitiin </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">“Amma fayyisi” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jechuu dha; kunis jecha galataa ti.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Inni maqaa Gooftaatiin dhufu eebbifamaa dha!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Zab 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="JHN 12:13" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">“Mootiin Israaʼel eebbifamaa dha!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Iisaanis ilmoo harree tokko argatee yaabbate; kunis akkuma akkana jedhamee barreeffamee dha;<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Yaa Intala Xiyoon, hin sodaatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">kunoo, mootiin kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">ilmoo harree yaabbatee dhufuutti jira.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak 9:9</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Barattoonni isaa jalqabatti waan kana hin hubanne. Erga Iisaan ulfina argatee booddee garuu akka wanni barreeffame kun waaʼee isaa taʼee fi akka isaanis waanuma kana isaaf godhan yaadatan.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Namoonni baayʼeen yommuu inni Alʼaazaarin qabrii keessaa waamee duʼaa kaasetti isa wajjin turanis ittuma fufanii dhugaa baʼan. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Namoonni baayʼeenis sababii mallattoo kana gochuu isaa dhagaʼaniif isa simachuu baʼan. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Kanaafuu Fariisonni, “Isin akka waa tokko illee gochuu hin dandeenye argitanii? Ilaa, addunyaan guutuun akkamitti akka isa duukaa buʼe ilaalaa!” waliin jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Duraan Dursee Waaʼee Duʼa Isaa Dubbate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Warra yeroo Ayyaanichaatti waaqeffachuuf ol baʼan keessaa tokko tokko Giriikota turan. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Isaanis Fiiliphoos namicha Beetisayidaa Galiilaatii dhufe sanatti dhiʼaatanii, “Yaa gooftaa, Iisaa arguu barbaanna” jedhaniin. <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Fiiliphoosis dhaqee Indiriiyaasitti hime; Indiriiyaasii fi Fiiliphoos immoo dhaqanii Iisaatti himan.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedhee isaaniif deebise; <char style="wj">“Saʼaatiin Ilmi Namaa itti ulfina argatu gaʼeera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; iji qamadii tokko yoo lafa buʼee duʼuu baate kophaa isaa hafa. Yoo duʼe garuu ija baayʼee naqata.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" /><char style="wj">Namni lubbuu isaa jaallatu kam iyyuu lubbuu isaa ni dhaba; kan addunyaa kana irratti lubbuu isaa jibbu immoo jireenya bara baraatiif lubbuu isaa kaaʼata.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" /><char style="wj">Namni na tajaajilu kam iyyuu na faana haa buʼu; iddoo ani jiru tajaajilaan koos ni jiraata. Abbaan koo nama na tajaajilu kamiif iyyuu ulfina ni kenna.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />
    <char style="wj">“Amma lubbuun koo dhiphatteerti; egaa ani maal jedhu ree? ‘Yaa Abbaa, saʼaatii kana jalaa na baasi;’ garuu ani sababii kanaafan gara saʼaatii kanaa dhufe.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" /><char style="wj">Yaa Abbaa, maqaa kee ulfeessi!”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Ergasii sagaleen, “Ani isa ulfeesseera; ammas nan ulfeessa” jedhu tokko shamaayʼuniidhaa dhufe. <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Tuunni achi dhaabachaa ture yommuu sagalee kana dhagaʼetti, “Ni kakawwise” jedhe. Warri kaan immoo, “Malaʼikkaa Allaahatu isatti dubbate” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Iisaan akkana jedhee deebise; <char style="wj">“Sagaleen kun sababii keessaniif dhufe malee sababii kootiif miti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" /><char style="wj">Yeroon itti addunyaa kanatti muramu amma; bulchaan addunyaa kanaas amma gad gatama.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" /><char style="wj">Ani garuu yeroon lafa irraa ol fuudhamutti nama hunda ofitti nan harkisa.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Innis akka duʼa akkamii duʼuuf jiru argisiisuuf kana jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Tuunnis deebisee, “Akka Al-Masiihiin bara baraan jiraatu nu Seera irraa dhageenyeerra; yoos ati akkamitti, <char style="wj">‘Ilmi Namaa ol fuudhamuu qaba’</char> jetta? ‘Ilmi Namaa’ kunis eenyu?” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Iisaan immoo akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Ifni yeroo gabaabaadhaaf isin bira jira. Akka dukkanni isin hin liqimsineef utuu ifa qabdanuu deddeebiʼaa. Namni dukkana keessa deddeebiʼu eessa akka dhaqu hin beekuutii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" /><char style="wj">Ijoollee ifaa akka taataniif utuu ifa qabdanuu ifa sanatti amanaa.”</char> Iisaanis erga waan kana dubbatee fixee booddee iddoo sanaa kaʼee isaan duraa dhokate.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amantii Dhabuu Yihuudootaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Iisaan fuula isaanii duratti mallattoo hedduu hojjetu iyyuu, isaan isatti hin amanne. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Kunis dubbiin Isaayyaas nabiiʼiyyichaa kan:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Yaa Gooftaa, ergaa keenya eenyutu amane?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Irreen Gooftaas eenyutti mulʼate?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:38">jedhu sun akka raawwatamuuf ture.<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Sababii kanaaf isaan amanuu hin dandeenye; Isaayyaas iddoo biraatti akkana jedheeraatii;<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Ija isaaniitiin akka hin argineef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">qalbii isaaniitiin akka hin hubanneef,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">akka ani isaan fayyisuufis akka gara kootti hin deebineef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">inni ija isaanii jaamseeraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">garaa isaaniis jabeesseera.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaayyaas sababii ulfina isaa argee waaʼee isaas dubbateef waan kana jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Taʼus hooggantoota keessaa iyyuu namoonni baayʼeen isatti amanan. Garuu waan mana sagadaatii nu baasu jedhanii Fariisota sodaataniif amantii isaanii ifatti hin baafne; <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />isaan ulfina Allaaha irra ulfina namaa jaallataniiruutii.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Iisaanis iyyee akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Namni natti amanu isa na erge sanatti amana malee natti miti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" /><char style="wj">Kan na argus isa na erge sana arga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" /><char style="wj">Akka namni natti amanu hundinuu dukkana keessa hin jiraanneef ani ifa taʼee gara addunyaa dhufeera.</char><verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />
    <char style="wj">“Namni yoo dubbii koo dhagaʼee eeguu baate kan isatti muru ana miti; ani addunyaa fayyisuufin dhufe malee itti muruuf hin dhufneetii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" /><char style="wj">Namni na didu kan dubbii koos hin fudhanne abbaa murtii tokko qaba; dubbiin ani dubbadhe sun guyyaa dhumaatti isatti mura.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" /><char style="wj">Garuu Abbaa isuma na erge sanatu akka ani waanan dubbadhe sana jedhu na ajaje malee ani ofii kootiin hin dubbanne.</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" /><char style="wj">Akka ajajni isaa jireenya bara baraa taʼe nan beeka. Kanaafuu wanni ani dubbadhu kam iyyuu waan akka ani dubbadhuuf Abbaan natti himee dha.”</char><verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Miilla Barattoota Isaa Dhiqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Yeroon sun Ayyaana Faasiikaatiin dura ture. Iisaanis akka addunyaa kana keessaa gara Abbaa dhaquudhaaf saʼaatiin isaa gaʼe ni beeke. Innis warra kan isaa taʼan kanneen addunyaa keessa turan ni jaallate; hamma dhumaattis isaan jaallate.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yeroo irbaataatti ibliis akka inni Iisaa dabarsee kennuuf Yihuudaa Keeriyoticha ilma Simoon keessa duraan dursee yaada kaaʼe. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Iisaanis akka Abbaan waan hunda harka isaatti kenne, akka Allaah biraa dhufee fi akka gara Allaahatti deebiʼu illee beeka ture; <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />kanaaf irbaata irraa kaʼee, wayyaa isaa kan irraan uffate of irraa fuudhee lafa kaaʼe; fooxaas mudhiitti hidhate. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ergasii gabateetti bishaan naqatee miilla barattootaa dhiquu fi fooxaa mudhiitti hidhate sanaanis haquu jalqabe.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Inni gara Simoon Phexros dhufe; Phexrosis, “Yaa Gooftaa, situ miilla koo naa dhiqaa?” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Iisaan immoo deebisee, <char style="wj">“Waan ani hojjechaa jiru ati amma hin beektu; booddee garuu ni hubatta”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Phexrosis, “Hin taʼu; ati gonkumaa miilla koo naa hin dhiqxu” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Iisaanis deebisee, <char style="wj">“Yoo ani siif dhiquu baadhe ati na biraa qooda hin qabaattu”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoon Phexrosis deebisee, “Yaa Gooftaa, yoos harka koo fi mataa koos malee miilla koo qofa hin taʼin” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Namni dhagna isaa dhiqate tokko miilla isaa qofa dhiqachuu isa barbaachisa; dhagni isaa guutuun qulqulluu dha. Isin qulqulluu dha; garuu hunda keessan miti”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Innis nama dabarsee isa kennuuf jiru beeka tureetii; sababiin inni, <char style="wj">“Qulqulluun hunda keessan miti”</char> jedheefis kanuma.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Innis erga miilla isaanii dhiqee booddee, uffata isaa uffatee iddoo isaatti deebiʼee taaʼe. Akkanas jedheen; <char style="wj">“Isin waan ani isiniif godhe hubattanii?</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" /><char style="wj">Isin, ‘Barsiisaa’, ‘Gooftaas’ naan jettu; anis waan isuma isin jettan taʼeef isin dhuguma jettan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" /><char style="wj">Yoos erga ani Gooftaa fi Barsiisaan keessan miilla keessan isinii dhiqee, isinis akkasuma miilla walii dhiquu qabdu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" /><char style="wj">Akkuma ani isinii godhe kana isinis akka gootaniif ani fakkeenya isinii kenneera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; garbichi gooftaa isaa hin caalu; malaʼikkaanis kan isa erge hin caalu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" /><char style="wj">Egaa isin yoo waan kana beektanii hojii irra oolchitan isin eebbifamoo dha.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Akka Dabarfamee Kennamu Duraan Dursee Dubbate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani waaʼee hunda keessanii dubbachaa hin jiru; ani warran filadhe nan beeka. Kun garuu dubbiin Katabbii Qulqulluu kan, ‘Inni buddeena koo nyaate koomee isaa natti ol fudhate’</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13:18 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Zab 41:9</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="wj">jedhu sun akka guutamuuf.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />
    <char style="wj">“Isin yommuu wanni kun taʼutti akka ani Isa taʼe akka amantaniif utuu inni hin taʼin amma isinitti nan hima.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; kan nama ani ergu kam iyyuu simatu hundinuu na simata; kan na simatu hundis isa na erge sana simata.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Iisaanis erga kana dubbatee booddee hafuuraan jeeqamee, <char style="wj">“Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; isin keessaa tokko dabarsee na kenna”</char> jedhee dhugaa baʼe.<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Barattoonni akka inni waaʼee eenyuu dubbate wallaalanii wal ilaalan. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Barattoota keessaas inni Iisaan isa jaallatu tokko Iisaatti irkatee maaddiitti dhiʼaatee ture. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoon Phexrosis, “Mee eenyuu jechuu isaa akka taʼe isa gaafadhu!” jedhee nyaaraan barataa sanatti hime.<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Innis qoma Iisaatti hirkatee, “Yaa Gooftaa, eenyu innii?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Iisaanis deebisee, <char style="wj">“Namichi ani buddeena afaan kaaʼata tokkoo caabii keessa cuuphee kennuuf isa”</char> jedhe. Innis buddeena caabii keessa cuuphee Yihuudaa ilma Simoon Keeriyotichaatiif kenne. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yihuudaas akkuma inni buddeenicha fudhateen Sheeyxaanni itti gale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:27">Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Waan gochuuf jirtu dafii godhi”</char> isaan jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Warra nyaataaf tataaʼan keessaas namni tokko iyyuu waan inni akkas isaan jedheef hin hubanne. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Sababii Yihuudaan korojoo maallaqaa baachaa tureefis isaan keessaa namoonni tokko tokko waan Iisaan, akka inni waan Ayyaanaaf barbaachisu bitu yookaan akka inni hiyyeeyyiif waa kennu isatti hime seʼan. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yihuudaanis akkuma buddeena sana fudhateen gad baʼe. Yeroon sunis halkan ture.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Akka Phexros Isa Ganu Duraan Dursee dubbate</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 13:37-38">13:37‑38</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:33-35">Mat 26:33‑35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:29-31">Mar 14:29‑31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:33-34">Luq 22:33‑34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Erga Yihuudaan gad baʼee booddee Iisaan akkana jedhe; <char style="wj">“Amma Ilmi Namaa ulfaateera; Allaahanis isaan ulfina argateera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" /><char style="wj">Allaahan erga isaan ulfina argatee, Allaahan ofuma isaatiin Ilma ulfeessa; inni takkumaan isa ulfeessa.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />
    <char style="wj">“Yaa ijoolle, ani yeroo gabaabaaf isin wajjinan jira. Isin na barbaaddu; ani akkuma Yihuudootaan, ‘Iddoo ani dhaqu isin dhufuu hin dandeessan’ jedhe sana ammas isiniin nan jedha.</char><verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />
    <char style="wj">“Akka isin wal jaallattaniif ani ajaja haaraa isiniifin kenna. Akkuma ani isin jaalladhetti isinis akkasuma wal jaalladhaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" /><char style="wj">Yoo isin jaalala waliif qabaattan namoonni hundinuu akka isin barattoota koo taatan kanaan ni beeku.”</char><verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoon Phexrosis, “Yaa Gooftaa, eessa dhaqxa?” jedhee isa gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Ati amma iddoo ani dhaqu na faana dhaquu hin dandeessu; gara booddeetti garuu na duukaa buuta”</char> jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Phexrosis, “Yaa Gooftaa, ani maaliifan amma si duukaa buʼuu hin dandeenye? Ani siif jedhee lubbuu koo nan kenna” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Iisaanis deebisee, <char style="wj">“Ati dhuguma naaf jettee lubbuu kee ni kennitaa? Ani dhuguman, dhuguman sitti hima; ati utuu indaanqoon hin iyyin yeroo sadii na ganta”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Barattoota Isaa Jajjabeesse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Garaan keessan hin raafamin. Allaahatti amanaa; nattis amanaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" /><char style="wj">Mana Abbaa koo keessa iddoo jireenyaa baayʼeetu jira; utuu akkana taʼuu baatee silaa isinittin hima ture. Ani iddoo isinii qopheessuuf achin dhaqaatii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" /><char style="wj">Anis yoon dhaqee iddoo isinii qopheesse, akka isinis iddoo ani jiru jiraattaniif deebiʼee dhufeen ofitti isin fudhadha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" /><char style="wj">Isinis karaa iddoo ani dhaquu ni beektu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Karaa Gara Abbaatti Geessu Taʼuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toomaasis, “Yaa Gooftaa, ati eessa akka dhaqxu nu hin beeknu; yoos akkamitti karaa sana beekuu dandeenya ree?” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Karaa fi dhugaan, jireenyis anuma. Yoo anaan taʼe malee eenyu iyyuu gara Abbaa hin dhufu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" /><char style="wj">Utuu na beektanii silaa Abbaa koos akkasuma ni beektu turtan; ammaa jalqabdaniis isa beektu; isas argitaniirtu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Fiiliphoos, “Yaa Gooftaa, Abbaa nutti argisiisi; kun nu gaʼaatii” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Iisaanis akkana isaan jedhe; <char style="wj">“Yaa Fiiliphoos, ani yeroo dheeraa akkanaa isin wajjin jiraadhee, ati amma illee na hin beeknee? Namni na arge Abbaas argeera. Yoos ati akkamitti, ‘Abbaa nutti argisiisi’ jechuu dandeessa ree?</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" /><char style="wj">Akka ani Abbaa keessa jiru, Abbaanis akka na keessa jiru ati hin amantuu? Ani dubbii isinitti dubbadhu kana ofuma kootiin hin dubbadhu. Garuu Abbaa isa na keessa jiraatutu hojii isaa hojjeta.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" /><char style="wj">Akka ani Abbaa keessa jiru, Abbaanis akka na keessa jiru na amanaa; yookaan sababii hojii sanaatiif na amanaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; namni natti amanu hojii ani hojjedhu ni hojjeta. Ani waanan gara Abbaa dhaquuf inni waan kana caalu iyyuu ni hojjeta.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" /><char style="wj">Akka Abbaan Ilmaan ulfina argatuuf ani waan isin maqaa kootiin kadhattan kam iyyuu nan raawwadha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" /><char style="wj">Yoo isin maqaa kootiin waan kam iyyuu na kadhattan ani nan raawwadha.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Akka Hafuura Qulqulluu Erguu Abdachiise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />
    <char style="wj">“Isin yoo na jaallattan ajaja koo eegaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" /><char style="wj">Ani Abbaa nan kadhadha; innis akka inni bara baraan isin wajjin jiraatuuf Jajjabeessaa biraa isinii kenna;</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" /><char style="wj">inni Hafuura dhugaa ti. Addunyaan waan isa hin arginee fi waan isa hin beekneef isa fudhachuu hin dandaʼu. Isin garuu waan inni isin wajjin jiraatuuf, isin keessas waan jiruuf isa ni beektu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" /><char style="wj">Ani akka ijoollee haadhaa fi abbaa hin qabneetti isin hin dhiisu; gara keessan nan dhufa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" /><char style="wj">Yeroo muraasa booddee addunyaan deebiʼee na hin argu; isin garuu na argitu. Sababii ani jiraadhuuf isinis ni jiraattu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" /><char style="wj">Akka ani Abbaa koo keessa jiru, akka isin na keessa jirtan akka anis isin keessa jiru gaafas ni beektu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" /><char style="wj">Namni ajajawwan koo qabu, isaanis kan eegu, inni na jaallata. Nama na jaallatu Abbaan koo ni jaallata; anis isa nan jaalladha; isattis of nan mulʼisa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yihuudaa Keeriyoticha utuu hin taʼin inni Yihuudaan kaan, “Yaa Gooftaa, ati maaliif addunyaatti utuu hin taʼin nutti of mulʼisuu barbaadda?” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Namni na jaallatu kam iyyuu dubbii koo ni eega. Abbaan koo isa ni jaallata; nus gara isaa ni dhufna; iddoo jireenyaas isa wajjin ni godhanna.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" /><char style="wj">Namni na hin jaallanne dubbii koo hin eegu. Dubbiin isin dhageessan kunis kan Abbaa na erge sanaati malee kan koo miti.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani utuman isin wajjin jiruu waan kana isinitti dubbadheera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" /><char style="wj">Jajjabeessaan sun, Hafuurri Qulqulluun kan Abbaan maqaa kootiin ergu garuu waan hunda isin barsiisa; waan ani isinitti hime hundas isin yaadachiisa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" /><char style="wj">Ani nagaa isin biratti nan hambisa; nagaa koos isiniif nan kenna. Ani akka addunyaan kennutti isiniif hin kennu. Garaan keessan hin raafamin; hin sodaatinis.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />
    <char style="wj">“Isin akka ani, ‘Ani nan deema; deebiʼees gara keessan nan dhufa’ jedhe dhageessaniirtu. Utuu na jaallattanii silaa gara Abbaa dhaquu kootti ni gammaddu turtan; Abbaan na caalaatii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" /><char style="wj">Akka yommuu wanni kun taʼutti isin amantaniif utuu wanni kun hin taʼin ani amma duraan dursee isinitti himeera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" /><char style="wj">Waan bulchaan addunyaa kanaa dhufuuf, ani siʼachi isin wajjin baayʼee hin dubbadhu; inni narraa homaa hin qabu;</char> <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" /><char style="wj">garuu akka ani Abbaa jaalladhu addunyaan akka beekuuf, ani akkuma Abbaan na ajajetti nan hojjedha.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">
    <char style="wj">“Kaʼaa, asii ni deemnaa.</char><verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Muka Wayiniitii fi Dameewwan Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani muka wayinii dhugaa ti; kan dhaabes Abbaa koo ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" /><char style="wj">Inni damee koo kan ija hin naqanne hunda muree gata; damee ija naqatu immoo akka inni caalaatti naqatuuf irraa qora.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" /><char style="wj">Isin dubbii ani isinitti dubbadheen amma qulqulluu dha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" /><char style="wj">Na keessa jiraadhaa; anis isin keessa nan jiraadhaa. Akkuma dameen yoo muka wayiniitti jiraate malee ofuma isaatiin ija naqachuu hin dandeenye, isinis yoo na keessa jiraattan malee ija naqachuu hin dandeessan.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani muka wayinii ti; isini immoo dameewwan. Namni yoo na keessa jiraate, anis yoon isa keessa jiraadhe inni ija baayʼee naqata; isin narraa gargar baatanii homaa gochuu hin dandeessaniitii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" /><char style="wj">Namni na keessa hin jiraanne akka damee gad gatamee goguu ti. Dameewwan akkanaa walitti qabamanii ibiddatti naqamu; ni gubamus.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" /><char style="wj">Isin yoo na keessa jiraattan, dubbiin koos yoo isin keessa jiraate, waanuma feetan kadhadhaa; innis isiniif ni kennama.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" /><char style="wj">Isin yoo ija baayʼee naqattanii fi yoo barattoota koo taatan, kanaan Abbaan koo ulfina argata.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />
    <char style="wj">“Akkuma Abbaan na jaallatetti anis akkasuma isin jaalladheera. Egaa jaalala koo keessa jiraadhaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" /><char style="wj">Akkuma ani ajajawwan Abbaa kootii eegee jaalala isaa keessa jiraadhu, isinis yoo ajajawwan koo eegdan jaalala koo keessa ni jiraattu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" /><char style="wj">Akka gammachuun koo isin keessa jiraatuu fi akka gammachuun keessanis guutuu taʼuuf ani waan kana isinitti himeera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" /><char style="wj">Ajajni koo isa kana: Akkuma ani isin jaalladhetti isinis wal jaalladhaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" /><char style="wj">Eenyu iyyuu jaalala guddaa kan namni lubbuu isaa dabarsee michoota isaatiif kennu sana irra caalu hin qabu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" /><char style="wj">Waan ani isin ajaje yoo raawwattan isin michoota koo ti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" /><char style="wj">Garbichi waan gooftaan isaa hojjetu waan hin beekneef, ani siʼachi garboota isiniin hin jedhu. Qooda kanaa ani michoota isiniin jedheera; ani waanan Abbaa koo irraa dhagaʼe hundumaa isin beeksiseeraatii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" /><char style="wj">Isinis akka dhaqxanii ija naqattaniif, iji keessanis akka jiraatuuf anatu isin filatee isin muude malee isin na hin filanne. Kunis akka Abbaan waan isin maqaa kootiin kadhattan kam iyyuu isinii kennuuf.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" /><char style="wj">Ajajni koo isa kana: Wal jaalladhaa.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Addunyaan Barattoota Jibbuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />
    <char style="wj">“Yoo addunyaan isin jibbe, akka inni isin dura na jibbe beekaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" /><char style="wj">Utuu isin kan addunyaa taatanii silaa addunyaan kan ofii isaa ni jaallata ture. Amma garuu waan ani addunyaa keessaa isin filadheef isin kan addunyaa miti. Kanaafuu addunyaan isin jibba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" /><char style="wj">Dubbii ani, ‘Garbichi gooftaa isaa hin caalu’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoh 13:16</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">jedhee isinitti hime sana yaadadhaa. Isaan erga na ariʼatanii, isinis ni ariʼatu. Yoo dubbii kootiif ajajaman, dubbii keessaniifis ni ajajamu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" /><char style="wj">Isaan waan Isa na erge sana hin beekneef, sababii maqaa kootiitiif waan kana hunda isin irratti raawwatu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" /><char style="wj">Utuu ani dhufee isaanitti himuu baadhee silaa cubbuu isaanitti hin taʼu ture. Amma garuu cubbuu isaaniitiif sababii dhiʼeeffatan hin qaban.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" /><char style="wj">Namni na jibbu Abbaa koos ni jibba.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" /><char style="wj">Utuu ani hojii namni biraa tokko iyyuu hin hojjetin gidduu isaaniitti hojjechuu baadhee silaa cubbuu isaanitti hin taʼu ture. Amma garuu utuma waan ani hojjedhe arganuu anas Abbaa koos jibbaniiru.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" /><char style="wj">Kunis akka dubbiin Seera isaanii keessatti, ‘Isaan akkasumaan na jibban’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Zab 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">jedhamee barreeffame sun raawwatamuuf taʼe.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />
    <char style="wj">“Jajjabeessaan ani Abbaa biraa isinii ergu, jechuunis Hafuurri Dhugaa inni Abbaa keessaa baʼu sun yommuu dhufutti waaʼee koo dhugaa baʼa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" /><char style="wj">Isinis jalqabaa kaaftanii waan na wajjin turtaniif dhugaa baatu.</char><verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani akka isin hin gufanneef jedhee wantoota kanneen isinitti himeera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" /><char style="wj">Isaan mana sagadaa keessaa isin ariʼu; dhugumaan yeroon itti namni isin ajjeesu kam iyyuu akka waan Allaah tajaajiluutti yaadu tokko ni dhufa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" /><char style="wj">Isaanis waan Abbaa yookaan na hin beekiniif wantoota kanneen godhu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" /><char style="wj">Anis akka isin yommuu yeroon sun gaʼutti isaan yaadattaniif wantoota kanneen isinitti himeera. Ani waanan isin wajjin tureef jalqabatti wantoota kanneen isinitti hin himne.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hojii Hafuura Qulqulluu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />
    <char style="wj">“Amma garuu ani gara isa na ergee nan dhaqa; taʼus isin keessaa namni, ‘Ati eessa dhaqxa?’ jedhee na gaafatu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" /><char style="wj">Garuu waan ani wantoota kanneen isinitti himeef garaan keessan gaddaan guutameera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" /><char style="wj">Ani garuu dhuguman isinitti hima; deemuun koo buʼaa isiniif qaba; yoo ani deeme malee Jajjabeessaan sun gara keessan hin dhufu; ani yoon deeme garuu isa isiniif nan erga.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" /><char style="wj">Innis yommuu dhufutti akka addunyaan waaʼee cubbuu, waaʼee qajeelummaatii fi waaʼee murtii dogoggoree jiru mirkaneessa;</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" /><char style="wj">waaʼee cubbuu, sababii namoonni natti hin amanneef;</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" /><char style="wj">waaʼee qajeelummaa, sababii ani gara Abbaa dhaquu fi sababii isinis siʼachi na hin argineef;</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" /><char style="wj">waaʼee murtii immoo sababii bulchaa addunyaa kanaatti murameef.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani amma iyyuu waanan isinitti himu baayʼee qaba; isin garuu amma baachuu hin dandeessan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" /><char style="wj">Hafuurri dhugaa sun yommuu dhufutti gara dhugaa hundaatti isin geessa. Inni waan dhagaʼu qofa dubbata malee ofuma isaatiin hin dubbatu; waan dhufuuf jirus isinitti hima.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" /><char style="wj">Inni sababii waanuma koo fuudhee isinitti beeksisuuf ulfina naa kenna.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" /><char style="wj">Wanni Abbaan qabu hundinuu kan koo ti. Inni waanuma koo fuudhee isinitti beeksisa jechuun koos kanumaaf.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />
    <char style="wj">“Isin yeroo muraasa booddee na hin argitan; yeroo muraasa booddee immoo deebitanii na argitu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gaddi Barattootaa Gammachuutti Ni Geeddarama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Barattoota isaa keessaas tokko tokko, “Inni, <char style="wj">‘Isin yeroo muraasaaf na hin argitan; yeroo muraasaaf immoo deebitanii na argitu’</char> akkanumas <char style="wj">‘Ani waanan gara Abbaa dhaquuf’</char> nuun jechuun isaa maal jechuu isaa ti?” waliin jedhan. <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Isaanis, “ <char style="wj">‘Yeroo muraasaaf’</char> jechuun isaa maal jechuu isaa ti? Maal jechuu isaa akka taʼe nu hin beeknu” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Iisaan immoo akka isaan isa gaafachuu barbaadan beekee akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Wanni ani, ‘Isin yeroo muraasaaf na hin argitan; yeroo muraasaaf immoo deebitanii na argitu’ jedhe sun maal jechuu koo akka taʼe wal gaafachaa jirtuu?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; isin ni boossu; ni gadittus. Addunyaan garuu ni gammada. Isin ni gadditu; gaddi keessan garuu gammachuutti ni geeddarama.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" /><char style="wj">Dubartiin yommuu ciniinsifattu, waan yeroon ishee gaʼeef ni gadditi; erga daaʼima deessee booddee garuu waan addunyaa irratti namni dhalateef, isheenis waan gammadduuf dhiphina sana hin yaadattu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" /><char style="wj">Isinis akkasuma amma gadditaniirtu; ani garuu deebiʼeen isin ilaala; garaan keessanis ni gammada. Gammachuu keessanis eenyu iyyuu isin irraa hin fudhatu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" /><char style="wj">Gaafas isin homaa na hin kadhattan. Ani dhuguman, dhuguman isinitti hima; Abbaan waan isin maqaa kootiin kadhattan kam iyyuu isinii kenna.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" /><char style="wj">Isin hamma ammaatti maqaa kootiin homaa hin kadhanne. Akka gammachuun keessan guutuu taʼuuf kadhadhaa ni argattu.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani wantoota kanneen fakkeenyaan isinitti himeera; garuu yeroon ani deebiʼee fakkeenyaan isinitti hin dubbanne ni dhufa; yommus ani waaʼee Abbaa koo ifaan ifatti isinittin hima.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" /><char style="wj">Isin gaafas maqaa kootiin ni kadhattu. Ani Abbaa isiniif nan kadhadha isiniin hin jedhu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" /><char style="wj">Isin waan na jaallattaniif, Allaah biraa baʼuu koo waan amantaniif Abbaan mataan isaa isin jaallata.</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" /><char style="wj">Ani Abbaa biraa baʼee gara addunyaa dhufeera; ammas addunyaa dhiisee gara Abbaa nan dhaqa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Barattoonni isaas akkana jedhan; “Kunoo, ati amma iyyuu fakkeenyaan utuu hin taʼin ifaan ifatti dubbachaa jirta. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Akka ati waan hunda beektuu fi akka namni tokko iyyuu gaaffii si gaafachuu hin barbaachifne nu amma ni beekna. Kanaanis nu akka ati Allaah biraa baate ni amanna.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Iisaanis deebisee akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Isin amma ni amantuu?</char> <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" /><char style="wj">Kunoo yeroon isin itti kophaatti na dhiiftanii tokkoon tokkoon keessan gara feetanitti bittinnooftan tokko ni dhufa. Ammuma iyyuu dhufeera. Garuu waan Abbaan koo na wajjin jiruuf ani kophaa koo miti.</char><verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />
    <char style="wj">“Akka isin anaan nagaa qabaattaniif ani wantoota kanneen isinitti himeera. Addunyaa kana irratti rakkinni isin argata. Garuu jabaadhaa! Ani addunyaa moʼadheeraa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Ofiif Duʼaa gochuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Iisaan wantoota kanneen dubbatee gara shamaayʼun ol ilaalee akkana jedhee duʼaa godhe:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JHN 17:1">
    <char style="wj">“Yaa Abbaa, saʼaatiin sun gaʼeera. Akka Ilmi kees ulfina siif kennuuf, ati Ilma keetiif ulfina kenni.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" /><char style="wj">Akka inni warra ati isaaf kennite hundaaf jireenya bara baraa kennuuf, nama hunda irratti taayitaa isaaf kenniteertaatii.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" /><char style="wj">Jireenyi bara baraas kana: innis akka isaan siʼi Allaah dhugaa tokkichaa fi Iisaa Al-Masiihii isa ati ergite sana beekaniif.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" /><char style="wj">Ani hojii ati akka ani hojjedhuuf natti kennite sana raawwachuudhaan lafa irratti ulfina siif kenneera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" /><char style="wj">Yaa Abbaa, amma immoo ati ulfina ani utuu addunyaan hin uumaminiin dura si biratti qabaadhe sanaan of biratti na ulfeessi.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Barattoota Isaatiif Duʼaa gochuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani namoota ati addunyaa keessaa naa kennitetti maqaa kee beeksiseera. Isaan kan kee turan; ati isaan naa kennite; isaanis dubbii kee eeganiiru.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" /><char style="wj">Isaan akka wanni ati anaaf kennite hundumtuu si biraa dhufe amma beekaniiru.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" /><char style="wj">Ani dubbii ati anaaf kennite isaaniif kenneeraatii; isaanis fudhataniiru. Akka ani si biraa baʼes dhugumaan beekaniiru; akka ati na ergites amananiiru.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" /><char style="wj">Ani isaaniif duʼaa nan godha. Warri ati naa kennite waan kan kee taʼaniif duʼaa isaaniifin godha malee addunyaaf duʼaa hin godhu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" /><char style="wj">Wanni ani qabu hundinuu kan kee ti; wanni ati qabdu hundinuus kan koo ti. Anis kanaan ulfina nan argadha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" /><char style="wj">Ani siʼachi addunyaa keessa hin turu; isaan garuu amma iyyuu addunyaa keessa jiru; ani gara kee nan dhufa. Yaa Abbaa Qulqulluu, akkuma nu tokko taane sana isaanis tokko akka taʼaniif maqaa kee kan naa kennite sanaan isaan eegi.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" /><char style="wj">Ani yeroo isaan wajjin turetti, maqaa kee kan ati naa kennite sanaan isaan nan eege; isaan eegeeras. Akka Katabbiin Qulqulluun raawwatamuufis ilma badii sana malee isaan keessaa namni tokko iyyuu hin badne.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />
    <char style="wj">“Amma garuu ani gara kee nan dhufa; gammachuun koos akka isaan keessatti guutuu taʼuuf, ani amma iyyuu utuman addunyaa keessa jiruu wantoota kanneen nan dubbadha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" /><char style="wj">Ani dubbii kee isaaniif kenneera; akkuma ani kan addunyaa hin taʼin, isaanis waan kan addunyaa hin taʼiniif, addunyaan isaan jibbeera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" /><char style="wj">Ani akka ati isa hamaa sana isaan irraa eegduuf malee akka ati addunyaa keessaa isaan baaftuuf si duʼaa hin godhu.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" /><char style="wj">Akkuma ani kan addunyaa hin taʼin isaanis akkasuma kan addunyaa miti.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" /><char style="wj">Dhugaadhaan isaan qulqulleessi; dubbiin kee dhugaa dha.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" /><char style="wj">Akkuma ati gara addunyaatti na ergite sana anis gara addunyaatti isaan ergeera.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" /><char style="wj">Akka isaanis dhugumaan qulqullaaʼaniif, ani isaaniif jedhee of nan qulqulleessa.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Amantoota Hundaaf Duʼaa gochuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />
    <char style="wj">“Ani warra dubbii isaaniitiin natti amananiifis malee isaan kana qofaaf duʼaa hin godhu;</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" /><char style="wj">kunis yaa Abbaa, akkuma ati na keessa jirtu, anis si keessa jiru sana, akka hundi isaanii tokko taʼaniif. Akka ati na ergite addunyaan akka amanuuf isaanis nu keessa haa jiraatan.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" /><char style="wj">Akkuma nu tokko taane isaanis tokko akka taʼaniif, ulfina ati naaf kennite sana anis isaaniif kenneera;</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" /><char style="wj">kunis akka isaan guutummaatti tokko taʼaniif ani isaan keessa nan jiraadha; ati immoo na keessa jiraatta. Yoos akka ati na ergitee fi akkuma na jaallattetti akka isaanis jaallatte addunyaan ni beeka.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />
    <char style="wj">“Yaa Abbaa, akka warri ati naa kennite kunneen iddoo ani jiru na wajjin jiraatanii fi akka isaan ulfina koo kan ati utuu addunyaan hin uumaminiin dura waan na jaallatteef naa kennite sana arganis nan barbaada.</char><verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />
    <char style="wj">“Yaa Abbaa Qajeelticha, addunyaan si hin beeku; ani garuu sin beeka; isaan kunis akka ati na ergite ni beeku.</char> <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" /><char style="wj">Akkan jaalalli ati ittiin na jaallatte sun isaan keessa jiraatuuf, anis akka isaan keessa jiraadhuuf ani akka maqaan kee isaan biratti beekamu godheera; akka beekamus nan godha.”</char><verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Qabame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">18:3‑11</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47‑56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43‑50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luq 22:47‑53</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Iisaan erga duʼaa godhee fixatee barattoota isaa wajjin Sulula Qeediroon gama iddoo biqiltuun ture tokkotti ceʼe; innis, barattoonni isaas achi keessa seenan.<verse eid="JHN 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Iisaan yeroo baayʼee barattoota isaa wajjin achitti wal argaa waan tureef, Yihuudaan inni Iisaa dabarsee kennu sunis iddoo sana beeka ture. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Kanaafuu Yihuudaan tuuta loltootaatii fi qondaaltota luboota hangafootaa fi Fariisota biraa ergaman dura deemaa achi dhufe. Isaanis guca, ibsaa fi miʼa lolaa qabatanii turan.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Iisaanis waan isa irra gaʼuuf jiru hunda beeknaan gad baʼee, <char style="wj">“Isin eenyun barbaaddu?”</char> jedhee isaan gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Isaanis deebisanii, “Iisaa isa Naazreeti” jedhan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Iisaan immoo, <char style="wj">“Ani isaa dha”</char> jedhe. Yihuudaan inni dabarsee isa kennu sunis jara wajjin achi dhaabachaa ture. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yommuu Iisaan, <char style="wj">“Ani isaa dha”</char> isaaniin jedhetti dugda duubatti deebiʼanii lafatti kukkufan.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Inni ammas, <char style="wj">“Isin eenyun barbaaddu?”</char> jedhee isaan gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Isaanis, “Iisaa isa Naazreeti” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Iisaanis deebisee, <char style="wj">“Ani, ‘Ani isaa dha’ isiniin jedheera. Kanaafuu, isin yoo na barbaaddan namoota kanneen dhiisaa haa deemanii!”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Kunis akka dubbiin inni, <char style="wj">“Ani warra ati naa kennite keessaa tokko illee hin ganne”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Yoh 6:39</ref></char></char></note> jedhee dubbate sun raawwatamuuf taʼe.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoon Phexros goraadee qabu luqqifatee garbicha luba ol aanaa dhaʼee gurra isaa mirgaa irraa kute. Maqaan garbicha sanaas Maalkoosii dha.<verse eid="JHN 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Iisaanis Phexrosiin, <char style="wj">“Goraadee kee manʼee isaatti deebisi! Ani xoofoo Abbaan naa kenne hin dhuguu?”</char> jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Haannaatti Geeffame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 18:12">18:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:13">13</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:57">Mat 26:57</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Tuunni loltootaa, ajajaan isaaniitii fi eegdonni Yihuudootaas Iisaa qabanii hidhan. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Isaanis duraan dursanii Haannaasitti isa geessan; Haannaas abbaa niitii Qayyaaffaa ti; Qayyaaffaan immoo bara sana luba ol aanaa ture. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Qayyaaffaan isa akka namni tokko uummataaf duʼuun wayyu Yihuudoota gorsee turee dha.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexros Yeroo Jalqabaatiif Iisaa Ganuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 18:16-18">18:16‑18</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:69">Mat 26:69</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:70">70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar 14:66‑68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luq 22:55‑57</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoon Phexrosii fi barataan biraa Iisaa faana buʼan. Barataan sunis waan luba ol aanaa biratti beekamaa tureef, Iisaa wajjin dallaa luba ol aanaa keessa seene; <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Phexros garuu balbala dura ala dhaabachaa ture. Barataan luba ol aanaa biratti beekamaa ture kaan gad baʼee intala balbala eegdutti himee Phexrosin ol seensise.<verse eid="JHN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Intalli balbala eegdu sunis Phexrosiin, “Atis barattoota namicha kanaa keessaa tokko mitii?” jette.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Inni immoo deebisee, “Ana miti” jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Yeroon isaa waan dhaamocha tureef garboonnii fi eegdonni ibidda qabsiifatanii dhadhaabatanii qaqqaammachaa turan. Phexrosis isaan wajjin dhaabatee qaqqaammachaa ture.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gaaffii Lubichi Ol aanaan Iisaaf Dhiʼeesse</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">18:19‑24</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:59-68">Mat 26:59‑68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-65">Mar 14:55‑65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">Luq 22:63‑71</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Yommus lubni ol aanaan waaʼee barattoota isaatii fi waaʼee barsiisa isaa Iisaa gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Iisaanis akkana jedhee deebiseef; <char style="wj">“Ani ifaan ifatti addunyaatti dubbadheera; iddoo Yihuudoonni hundi itti walitti qabamanitti, manneen sagadaattii fi mana qulqullummaa keessattis ani yeroo hunda barsiisaan ture. Ani waan tokko illee icciitiidhaan hin dubbanne.</char> <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" /><char style="wj">Ati maaliif na gaafatta? Warra waan ani isaaniin jedhe dhagaʼan gaafadhu. Kunoo isaan waan ani jedhe beeku.”</char><verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yommuu Iisaan wantoota kanneen jedhetti qondaaltota achi ijaajjaa turan keessaa tokko, “Luba ol aanaaf akkana deebiftaa?” jedhee isa kabale.<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Iisaanis deebisee, <char style="wj">“Yoo ani waan hamaa dubbadhee jiraadhe, waan hamaa sana dhugaa baʼi. Yoo ani waan qajeelaa dubbadhee jiraadhe garuu ati maaliif na rukutta?”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Haannaasis Iisaa akkuma inni hidhamee jirutti gara lubicha ol aanaa, gara Qayyaaffaatti erge.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexros Yeroo Lammaffaa fi Sadaffaa Iisaa Ganuu Isaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25‑27</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71‑75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar 14:69‑72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luq 22:58‑62</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoon Phexros dhaabatee ibidda qaqqaammachaa ture. Kanaafuu isaan, “Atis barattoota isaa keessaa tokko mitii?” jedhaniin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Inni immoo, “Ana mitii” jedhee haale.<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Garboota luba ol aanaa keessaas firri namicha Phexros gurra isaa irraa kute sanaa tokko, “Ani iddoo biqiltuutti isa wajjin si hin arginee?” jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Phexros ammas ni gane; yommusuma indaanqoon iyye.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaa Fuula Phiilaaxoos Duratti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 18:29-40">18:29‑40</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:11-18">Mat 27:11‑18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:20-23">20‑23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:2-15">Mar 15:2‑15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:2">Luq 23:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:3">3</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:18-25">18‑25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Yihuudoonnis Iisaa mana Qayyaaffaatii fuudhanii masaraa bulchaa warra Roomaatti geessan. Yeroon sun ganama barii ture; Yihuudoonnis akka hin xuroofneef jedhanii masaraa ol hin seenne; kunis akka Faasiikaa nyaachuu dandaʼaniif. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Kanaafuu Phiilaaxoos gara isaaniitti gad baʼee, “Himanni isin namicha kana irratti dhiʼeessitan maali?” jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Isaanis, “Utuu namichi kun yakka hojjechuu baatee nu silaa isa dabarsinee sitti hin kenninu ture” jedhanii deebisaniif.<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Phiilaaxoosis, “Isin ofuma keessanii isa fuudhaatii akka seera keessaniitti itti muraa” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Yihuudoonnis, “Nu garuu nama tokko illee ajjeesuuf mirga hin qabnu” jedhaniin. <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Kunis wanni Iisaan akka duʼa akkamiitiin duʼuuf jiru argisiisuuf jedhee dubbate sun akka raawwatamuuf taʼe.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Phiilaaxoos ammas masaraa mootummaa seene; Iisaanis ofitti waamee, “Ati mootii Yihuudootaatii?” jedhee isa gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Waan kana sumatu jedhe moo namoota biraatu waaʼee koo sitti hime?”</char> jedhee gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Phiilaaxoosis deebisee, “Anatu Yihuudiidhaa ree? Kan dabarsee natti si kenne sabuma keetii fi luboota hangafoota. Garuu ati maali gooteeti?” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Mootummaan koo kan addunyaa kanaati miti. Utuu kan addunyaa kanaa taʼee silaa akka ani dabarfamee Yihuudootatti hin kennamneef tajaajiltoonni koo naa lolu turan. Amma garuu mootummaan koo kan addunyaa kanaa miti”</char> jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Phiilaaxoosis, “Yoos ati mootii dha kaa!” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Iisaan immoo, <char style="wj">“Akka ani mootii taʼe atuu jette. Dhugumaan wanni ani dhaladhee gara addunyaa dhufeefis dhugaadhaaf dhugaa baʼuuf. Namni dhugaaf dhaabatu hundinuu sagalee koo dhagaʼa”</char> jedhee deebise.<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Phiilaaxoosis, “Dhugaan maal inni?” jedheen. Innis erga waan kana dubbatee booddee amma illee Yihuudootatti gad baʼee akkana jedheen; “Ani balleessaa tokko illee isa irratti hin arganne. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Garuu isin akka ani yeroo Faasiikaatti nama tokko gad isinii dhiisu bartee godhattaniirtu. Kanaafuu akka ani, ‘Mootii Yihuudootaa’ gad isiniif dhiisu barbaadduu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Isaan amma illee iyyanii, “Lakki, Barabbaas malee isa miti!” jedhan. Barbaas kun saamtuu ture.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Fannifamuun Iisaatti Murame</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1‑16</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27:27‑31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar 15:16‑20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Phiilaaxoosis Iisaa fuudhee garafsiise. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Loltoonnis gonfoo qoraattii micciiranii dhaʼanii mataa isaa irra kaaʼan. Isaanis uffata dhiilgee isatti uffisanii, <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />“Akkam ree, yaa Mootii Yihuudootaa!” jechaa gara isaatti deddeebiʼaa turan. Isas ni kabalan.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Phiilaaxoos amma illee gad baʼee Yihuudootaan, “Akka ani balleessaa tokko illee isa irratti hin argatin akka beektaniif kunoo ani isa gad isiniifin baasa” jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Iisaanis gonfoo qoraattii kaaʼatee, wayyaa dhiilgees uffatee gad baʼe; Phiilaaxoosis, “Namichi kunoo ti!” isaaniin jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Luboonni hangafoonnii fi qondaaltonni isaanii yommuu isa arganitti, “Fannisi! Fannisi!” jedhanii iyyan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Phiilaaxoos immoo deebisee, “Isin ofuma keessanii fuudhaatii isa fannisaa malee ani balleessaa tokko iyyuu isa irratti hin arganne” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Yihuudoonnis deebisanii, “Nu seera qabna; namichi kun waan Ilma Allaaha of godheef akka seera keenyaatti duʼuu qaba” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Phiilaaxoosis yommuu dubbii kana dhagaʼetti ittuma caalchisee sodaate. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Innis masaraatti ol deebiʼee, “Ati nama eessaati?” jedhee Iisaa gaafate. Iisaan garuu deebii tokko iyyuu hin kennineef. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Phiilaaxoosis, “Ati na jalaa dubbachuu diddaa? Akka ani gad si dhiisuuf taayitaa qabuu fi akka ani si fannisuuf taayitaa qabu ati hin beektuu?” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Iisaan immoo, <char style="wj">“Ati utuu olii siif kennamuu baatee silaa taayitaa tokko illee narratti hin qabdu ture. Kanaaf inni dabarsee sitti na kenne sun cubbuu cubbuu caalu qaba”</char> jedhee deebiseef.<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Phiilaaxoosis yeroo sanaa jalqabee Iisaa gad dhiisuu barbaada ture; Yihuudoonni garuu, “Ati yoo namicha kana gad dhiifte michuu Qeesaar miti. Namni mootii of godhu kam iyyuu Qeesaariin morma” jedhanii iyyan.<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Phiilaaxoosis yommuu dubbii kana dhagaʼetti Iisaa gad baasee, iddoo “Dhagaa Afamaa” kan afaan Ibraayisxiitiin “Gabataa” jedhamutti barcuma murtii irra taaʼe. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Guyyaan sunis guyyaa Qophii Faasiikaa ture; yeroon isaas gara saʼaatii jaʼaa ture.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:14">Phiilaaxoosis Yihuudootaan, “Mootiin keessan kunoo ti!” jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Isaan garuu, “Isa balleessi! Isa balleessi! Isa fannisi!” jedhanii iyyan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Phiilaaxoos immoo, “Mootii keessan fannisu moo?” jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Luboonni hangafoonnis, “Nu Qeesaar malee mootii biraa hin qabnu” jedhanii deebisaniif.<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Kanaaf Phiilaaxoos akka inni fannifamuuf dabarsee isaanitti kenne.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Iisaan Fannifame</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="JHN 19:17-24">19:17‑24</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:33-44">Mat 27:33‑44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:22-32">Mar 15:22‑32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33-43">Luq 23:33‑43</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Isaanis Iisaa fuudhanii deeman. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Innis fannoo ofii isaa baadhatee iddoo Buqqee Mataa kan afaan Ibraayisxiitiin <char style="tl">Golgootaa</char> jedhamutti ol baʼe. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Isaanis achitti isa fannisan; isa wajjinis namoota biraa lama, isa tokko garanaan, kaan immoo garasiin, Iisaa immoo gidduu isaaniitti fannisan.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Phiilaaxoosis Katabbii,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="JHN 19:19">Iisaa Isa Naazreeti, Mooticha Yihuudootaa,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:19">jedhu tokko barreessee fannoo sanatti maxxanse. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Iddoon Iisaan itti fannifame waan magaalaatti dhiʼoo tureef Yihuudoonni hedduun katabbii sana dubbisaniiru; katabbiin sunis afaan Ibraayisxiitiin, Laatiinii fi Giriikiin barreeffame. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Luboonni Yihuudootaa hangafoonni Phiilaaxoosiin, “Namichi kun, ‘ “Ani mootii Yihuudootaa ti” jedheera’ jedhii barreessi malee, ‘Inni Mootii Yihuudootaa ti’ jettee hin barreessin” jedhan.<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Phiilaaxoosis, “Ani waanan barreesse, barreesseera” jedhee deebise.<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Loltoonni sunis erga Iisaa fannisanii booddee kittaa isaa hambisanii wayyaa isaa fuudhanii akka tokko tokko isaan gaʼuuf iddoo afuritti hiratan. Kittaan sun hin hodhamne; olii hamma gadiittis dhaʼaa tokko ture.<verse eid="JHN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Kanaafuu isaan, “Kottaa hin tarsaasnuu; garuu ixaa buufannee akka inni kan eenyuu taʼu ilaallaa”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Zab 22:18</ref></char></char></note> waliin jedhan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Kunis akka Katabbiin Qulqulluun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Isaan wayyaa koo hiratan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">uffata koottis ixaa buufatan”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">jedhu sun raawwatamuuf taʼe. Wanni loltoonni godhanis kanuma.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Fannoo Iisaa biras haati isaa, obboleettiin haadha isaa, Mariyaam niitiin Qilophaatii fi Mariyaam isheen Magdalaa dhaabatanii turan. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Iisaanis yommuu haadha isaatii fi barataa inni jaallatu sana utuu inni ishee cina dhaabatuu argetti haadha isaatiin, <char style="wj">“Dubartii nana! Kunoo, ilma kee”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Barataa sanaan illee, <char style="wj">“Kunoo haadha kee”</char> jedhe; barataan sunis saʼaatii sanaa jalqabee gara mana isaatti ishee fudhate.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duʼa Iisaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 19:29">19:29</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:30">30</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:48">Mat 27:48</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:36">Mar 15:36</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:36">Luq 23:36</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ergasii Iisaan akka wanni hundinuu raawwatame beekee akka Katabbiin Qulqulluun raawwatamuuf, <char style="wj">“Nan dheebodhe”</char> jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Qodaan dhangaggaaʼaa qabu tokko achi ture; isaanis dhangaggaaʼaa sana keessa ispoonjii cuuphanii hiisophiitti kaaʼanii afaan isaatti qaban. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Iisaanis dhangaggaaʼaa sana fudhatee, <char style="wj">“Raawwateera”</char> jedhe. Mataa buusees hafuura isaa kenne.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Guyyaan sun guyyaa Qophii ture; guyyaan itti aanus Sanbataa addaa ture. Kanaafuu akka reeffi isaanii Sanbataan fannoo irra hin oolle gochuuf jedhanii akka miilli isaanii cabsamee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Akka miilli isaanii cabsame </char><char style="ft" closed="false">– Miilla yakkamtootaa burrusa guddaadhaan cabsuun gosa adabbii hamaa ture. Walumaa galatti miilla qofatu cabsama ture. Yeroo tokko tokko garuu harkis ni cabsama ture. Adabbiin kun yommuu nama fannifamaa jiru irratti raawwatamutti mataa isaatiin gosa adabbii gara jabinaa ti. Garuu dhiphinni duʼa fannoo kan lubbuun daftee keessaa hin baane sun waan yeroo gabaabaa keessatti raawwatuuf akka gocha araaraatti ilaalama.</char></note> fannoo irraa gad buufamuuf Yihuudoonni Phiilaaxoosin kadhatan. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Kanaafuu loltoonni dhaqanii miilla namicha jalqabaa, miilla namicha Iisaa wajjin fannifame kaaniis cabsan. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Yommuu gara Iisaa dhufanitti garuu inni duʼe waan arganiif miilla isaa hin cabsine. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Loltoota sana keessaa inni tokko garuu eeboodhaan cinaacha isaa waraane; yeruma sana dhiignii fi bishaan baʼe. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Namni waan kana arge rageesseera; ragaan isaas dhugaa dha. Inni akka dhugaa dubbatu ni beeka; inni akka isinis amantaniif dubbata. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Kunis wanni Katabbiin Qulqulluun, “Lafeen isaa tokko iyyuu hin cabsamu”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Bau 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Lak 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Zab 34:20</ref></char></char></note> jedhe sun akka raawwatamuuf taʼe. <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Ammas Katabbiin Qulqulluun biraa, “Isaanis isa waraanan sana ni ilaalu”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zak 12:10</ref></char></char></note> jedha.<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qabbaramuu Iisaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">19:38‑42</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57‑61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42‑47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luq 23:50‑56</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ergasii Yuusuf namni Armaatiyaa kan sababii Yihuudoota sodaateef dhoksaan barataa Iisaa ture sun reeffa Iisaa fudhachuuf Phiilaaxoosin kadhate. Phiilaaxoosis isaaf eeyyame; kanaafuu inni dhaqee reeffa Iisaa fudhate. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Niqoodemoos inni duraan halkaniin gara Iisaa dhufee tures walmakaa qumbiitii fi argeessa gara kiiloo giraamii soddomii afur ulfaatu qabatee dhufe. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Isaanis reeffa Iisaa fuudhanii akka duudhaa Yihuudootaatti qabbaruuf urgooftuu wajjin huccuu quncee talbaa irraa hojjetameen kafanan. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Iddoo Iisaan itti fannifames lafa biqiltuu tokkotu ture; lafa biqiltuu sana keessas iddoo qabrii haaraa kan namni tokko iyyuu duraan itti hin qabbaramin tokkotu ture. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Sababii guyyaan sun guyyaa Qophii Yihuudootaa turee fi iddoon qabrii sunis waan dhiʼoo tureef Iisaa achi keessa kaaʼan.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Qabrii Duwwaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="JHN 20:1-8">20:1‑8</ref> kwf – <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1‑8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1‑8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-10">Luq 24:1‑10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Guyyaa jalqaba torban sanaa ganama barii utuma dukkanaaʼee jiruu Mariyaam isheen Magdalaa gara qabrii dhaqxee akka dhagaan afaan qabrii sanaa irraa fuudhame argite. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Kanaafuu isheen fiigaa gara Simoon Phexrosii fi gara barataa biraa kan Iisaan isa jaallate sanaa dhaqxee, “Gooftaa qabrii keessaa fudhataniiru; eessa akka isa kaaʼanis hin beeknu!” jetteen.<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Kanaafuu Phexrosii fi barataan kaan baʼanii gara qabrii dhaqan. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Lachan isaanii iyyuu ni fiigu turan; barataan kaan garuu Phexros bira darbee fiiguudhaan dursee iddoo qabrii sana gaʼe. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Innis gad jedhee ilaalee huccuu quncee talbaa irraa hojjetame lafatti arge malee qabrii keessa hin seenne. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoon Phexros immoo isa duubaan dhufee qabrii keessa seene. Huccuu sanas lafatti arge; <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />akkanumas huccuu mataa Iisaatti maramee ture arge. Huccuun sunis kophaa isaa dachaafamee iddoo biraa ture malee huccuu quncee talbaa irraa hojjetame sana bira hin turre. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Ergasiis barataan biraa inni jalqabatti qabrii bira gaʼe sun keessa seene. Innis argee amane. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Isaan akka Iisaan warra duʼan keessaa kaʼu Katabbii Qulqulluu irraa amma iyyuu hin beekne tureetii.<verse eid="JHN 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Mariyaam Ishee Magdalaatti Mulʼate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Barattoonni sunis gara mana isaaniitti deebiʼan.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mariyaam garuu alaan qabrii bira dhaabattee booʼaa turte. Utuma boossuus qabriitti gad jettee ilaalte; <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />isheenis malaʼikkoota lama kanneen uffata adaadii uffatanii iddoo reeffi Iisaa kaaʼamee ture sana, inni tokko mataa duraan, kaan immoo miilla jalaan taaʼan argite.<verse eid="JHN 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Isaanis, “Dubartii nana, maaliif boossa?” jedhaniin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Isheen immoo, “Gooftaa koo fudhataniiru; eessa akka isa kaaʼanis ani hin beeku” jetteen. <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Yommuu waan kana dubbattee of irra gara galtettis Iisaa achi dhaabatu argite; garuu Iisaa taʼuu isaa hin beekne.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Dubartii nana, maaliif boossa? Eenyun barbaadda?”</char> jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Isheen immoo, nama iddoo biqiltuu keessa hojjetu seetee, “Yaa gooftaa, ati yoo isa fuutee jiraatte, akka ani dhaqee fudhadhuuf eessa akka isa keesse natti himi” jetteen.<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Mariyaam!”</char> jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Isheenis isatti gara galtee afaan Ibraayisxiitiin, <char style="tl">“Rabbuunii!”</char> jetteen. Hiikkaan isaas “Barsiisaa” jechuu dha.<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Iisaan immoo, <char style="wj">“Ani amma illee waan gara Abbaatti ol hin baʼiniif na hin tuqin. Garuu obboloota koo bira dhaqiitii, ‘Ani gara Abbaa kootii fi Abbaa keessaniitti, gara Allaah kootii fi Allaah keessaniitti ol nan baʼa’ jedheera jedhiitii isaanitti himi”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mariyaam isheen Magdalaas gara barattootaa dhaqxee, “Ani Gooftaa argeera!” jette. Akka inni waan kana isheen jedhes isaanitti himte.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Barattoota Isaatti Mulʼate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Guyyaa jalqaba torban sanaa galgala utuu barattoonni waan Yihuudoota sodaataniif balbala cufatanii walitti qabamanii jiranuu Iisaan dhufee isaan gidduu dhaabatee, <char style="wj">“Assalaam aleeyikum”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Innis erga waan kana dubbatee booddee harka isaatii fi cinaacha isaa isaanitti argisiise. Barattoonnis yommuu Gooftaa arganitti akka malee gammadan.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Iisaan amma illee, <char style="wj">“Assalaam aleeyikum! Akkuma Abbaan na erge sana anis isinan erga”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Innis erga waan kana jedhee booddee Hafuura isaanitti baafatee akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Hafuura Qulqulluu fudhadhaa.</char> <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" /><char style="wj">Yoo isin namootaaf cubbuu isaanii dhiiftan isaaniif ni dhiifama; yoo isaaniif dhiisuu baattan immoo isaaniif hin dhiifamu.”</char><verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Toomaasitti Mulʼate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Garuu yeroo Iisaan dhufetti warra Kudha Lamaan keessaa Toomaas inni Didimoos jedhamu tokko barattoota wajjin hin turre. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Kanaafuu barattoonni warri kaan, “Nu Gooftaa argineerra!” jedhanii isatti himan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Inni garuu, “Ani iddoo mismaaraan waraaname harka isaa irratti argu malee, quba koo iddoo mismaaraa sana keessa kaaʼu malee, harka koos cinaacha isaa keessa kaaʼu malee hin amanu” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Guyyaa saddeeti booddee barattoonni isaa ammas mana keessa turan; Toomaasis isaan wajjin ture. Utuma balbalichi cufamee jiruus Iisaan ol galee isaan gidduu dhaabatee, <char style="wj">“Assalaam aleeyikum!”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Innis Toomaasiin, <char style="wj">“Quba kee as fidi; harka koo ilaali. Harka kee diriirfadhuutii cinaacha koo keessa kaaʼi. Amani malee amantii hin dhabin”</char> jedhe.<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toomaas immoo, “Gooftaa koo! Allaah koo!” jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Ati waan na argiteef amante; warri utuu hin argin amanan eebbifamoo dha”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Iisaan barattoota isaa duratti mallattoowwan biraa kanneen kitaaba kana keessatti hin barreeffamin hedduu hojjete. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Wantoonni kunneen garuu akka Iisaan inni Al-Masiihi Ilma Allaaha taʼe akka amantaniif, amanuudhaanis akka maqaa isaatiin jireenya qabaattaniif barreeffame.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Iisaa fi Dinqii Qurxummii Qabuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Wantoota kanneen booddee Iisaan ammas galaana Xibeeriyaas biratti barattoota isaatti of mulʼise. Haalli inni ittiin of mulʼises akkana ture: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoon Phexros, Toomaas inni Didimoos jedhamu, Naatnaaʼel namichi Qaanaa Galiilaa, ilmaan Zabdewoosii fi barattoonni biraa lama walii wajjin turan. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoon Phexrosis, “Ani qurxummii qabuu nan dhaqa” isaaniin jedhe; isaanis, “Nus si wajjin dhaqna” jedhaniin. Gad baʼaniis bidiruu yaabbatan; halkan sana garuu homaa hin qabne.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ganama bariidhaanis Iisaan qarqara galaanichaa irra dhaabachaa ture; barattoonni garuu akka inni Iisaa taʼe hin beekne.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Innis isaan waamee, <char style="wj">“Ijoolle, qurxummii tokko illee hin qabdanii?”</char> jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Isaan immoo, “Hin qabnu” jedhanii deebisan.<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Innis, <char style="wj">“Karaa mirga bidiruutiin kiyyoo gad darbadhaa; qurxummii ni argattuu”</char> jedheen. Kanaafuu isaan kiyyoo sana gad darbatan; sababii baayʼina qurxummiitiifis kiyyoo sana harkisuu dadhaban.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Barataan inni Iisaan isa jaallachaa ture sunis, “Inni Gooftaa dha!” jedhee Phexrositti hime. Kanaafuu Simoon Phexros yommuu “Inni Gooftaa dha” jechuu isaa dhagaʼetti waan marxoo isaa of irraa baasee tureef, marxoo isaa marxifatee bishaanitti gad utaale. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Barattoonni kaan garuu waan qarqara galaanaa irraa dhundhuma dhibba lama caalaa hin fagaatiniif kiyyoo qurxummiin keessa guute sana harkisaa bidiruudhaan dhufan. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Yommuu lafatti baʼanittis ibidda cilee kan qurxummiin irra jiruu fi buddeena achitti argan.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Mee qurxummii amma qabdan irraa waa fidaa!”</char> isaaniin jedhe. <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoon Phexrosis bidiruu sana yaabbatee kiyyoo qurxummiin gurguddaan 153 guute sana gara lafaatti harkise. Kiyyoon sunis qurxummii akkas baayʼattuun guutamu illee hin tarsaane. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Kottaa ciree nyaadhaa!”</char> isaaniin jedhe. Barattoota keessaas namni ija jabaatee, “Ati eenyu?” jedhee isa gaafate tokko iyyuu hin turre. Isaan akka inni Gooftaa taʼe beekaniiruutii. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Iisaanis dhufee buddeena sana fuudhee isaaniif kenne; qurxummichas akkasuma godhe. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Egaa Iisaan erga duʼaa kaafamee, kana wajjin yeroo sadaffaa barattoota isaatti mulʼate.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iisaan Phexrosin Gaaffii Gaafate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Iisaan erga isaan ciree nyaatanii booddee Simʼoon Phexrosiin, <char style="wj">“Yaa Simoon ilma Yohannis, ati warra kana caalaa na jaallattaa?”</char> jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Innis, “Eeyyee, yaa Gooftaa; akka ani si jaalladhu atuu ni beekta” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Iisaanis, <char style="wj">“Ilmoolee hoolaa koo soori”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Iisaan amma illee, <char style="wj">“Yaa Simoon ilma Yohannis, ati na jaallattaa?”</char> jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Innis deebisee, “Eeyyee, yaa Gooftaa, akka ani si jaalladhu atuu ni beekta” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Iisaan immoo, <char style="wj">“Hoolota koo tiksi”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yeroo sadaffaas, <char style="wj">“Yaa Simoon ilma Yohannis, ati na jaallattaa?”</char> jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Phexrosis sababii Iisaan yeroo sadaffaa, <char style="wj">“Ati na jaallattaa?”</char> jedhee isa gaafateef gaddee, “Yaa Gooftaa, ati waan hunda beekta; akka ani si jaalladhus ni beekta” jedheen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Iisaanis akkana jedheen; <char style="wj">“Hoolota koo soori.</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" /><char style="wj">Ani dhuguman, dhuguman sitti hima; ati yeroo dargaggeessa turtetti, ofuma keetiin mudhii kee hidhattee lafa barbaadde dhaqxa turte; yeroo dulloomtutti garuu harka kee ni diriirfatta; namni biraas mudhii kee siif hidhee lafa ati hin barbaannetti si geessa.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Iisaanis akka Phexros duʼa akkamiitiin Allaah ulfeessu argisiisuuf jedhee waan kana dubbate; ergasii, <char style="wj">“Na duukaa buʼi”</char> jedheen.<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Phexrosis garagalee utuu barataan inni Iisaan isa jaallatu sun isaan duukaa buʼuu arge. Barataan kunis isa yeroo irbaataatti qoma Iisaatti irkatee, “Yaa Gooftaa, inni dabarsee si kennu eenyu?” jedhe sanaa dha. <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Phexrosis yommuu isa argetti, “Yaa Gooftaa, namichi kun hoo?” jedhee Iisaa gaafate.<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Iisaanis deebisee, <char style="wj">“Hamma ani dhufutti akka inni jiraatu yoo fedhii koo taʼe, maaltu si dhibe? Ati na duukaa buʼi”</char> jedheen. <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Kanaaf oduun, “Barataan kun hin duʼu” jedhu obboloota gidduutti odeeffame. Iisaan garuu, <char style="wj">“Hamma ani dhufutti akka inni jiraatu yoo fedhii koo taʼe maaltu si dhibe?”</char> jedhe malee, <char style="wj">“Inni hin duʼu”</char> hin jenne.<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Inni dubbii kana dhugaa baʼu, kan waan kanas barreesse barataadhuma kana. Akka dhuga baʼumsi isaa dhugaa taʼes nu beekna.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Kana malees Iisaan waan biraa baayʼee hojjeteera. Utuu tokkoon tokkoon isaanii barreeffamanii jiraatanii silaa ani waan addunyaan mataan ishee iyyuu kitaabota barreeffaman sanaaf iddoo gaʼu qabdu hin seʼu.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>